import{S as e,T as t,w as n}from"./schema-Dvb4bcnc.js";var r={name:`Water Tank Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Clean water starts at the tank`,intro:`Water tank cleaning in Gurgaon removes silt, algae and mosquito larvae from overhead and underground tanks, so the first glass of water your family drinks is not carrying months of rooftop dust and monsoon silt.`,detail:`The tank above your kitchen or below your parking is the least cleaned surface in any Gurgaon home. An overhead tank on the terrace collects monsoon dust, dried leaves, bird droppings and mosquito eggs; an underground pit collects silt, iron sediment and the residue of years of hard water. Both keep feeding the taps, and the first glass out of the tap carries the worst of it. It is also the only fix for weak top-floor pressure, where scale has narrowed the outlet.

Our tank cleaners close the inlet, pump the water down to the sludge line and lift the debris out with a silt net. The walls and base get an alkaline tank cleaner that breaks down algae and greasy film, followed by a descaler that dissolves the hard-water crust — a concrete pit needs a stronger treatment than a plastic tank, so the product is matched to the material. The tank is then rinsed from the top down, disinfected with a food-safe solution, refilled and left to aerate. Motor servicing and float replacement are not part of the clean; we report them and quote separately.

An overhead tank cleaning is ₹399 and an underground tank is ₹999, fixed before the crew arrives. What moves the number is size and depth: a 1,000-litre tank is quoted above it, and a pit deeper than 1.5 metres needs a longer pump-out. Access matters too: a terrace with a clear opening is quicker than a tank behind a lift machine room.

We run tank cleaning across DLF Phase 1–5, Sohna Road, Golf Course Road, Palam Vihar, Sushant Lok, Sector 45–57 and the newer sectors off Dwarka Expressway, and societies usually book it as a cluster day for a whole tower. Monsoon and the weeks before Diwali are the busiest windows, so book early. If a new flat is being handed over, pair the tank service with a [full deep clean](/deep-cleaning-services-in-gurgaon.html) so the pipes and the storage are reset together.`,image:`/images/full-home-3bhk-deep-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Technician scrubbing the interior of an overhead water tank on a Gurgaon apartment terrace`,includes:[`Overhead tank interior scrub & disinfection`,`Underground pit silt & debris removal`,`Algae and mosquito larvae treatment`,`Hard-water scale dissolved from walls`,`Food-safe disinfection of tank base`,`Inlet, outlet and overflow line check`,`Rinse, refill and water clarity test`,`Old sludge and debris removed from site`],process:[{step:1,title:`Shut & Inspect`,desc:`We check the tank material, size and access, then close the inlet so the supply stays clean during the work.`},{step:2,title:`Drain & Scrub`,desc:`Water is pumped out and the sludge line cleared, then the walls and base are scrubbed with a tank-safe cleaner.`},{step:3,title:`Descale & Disinfect`,desc:`The hard-water crust is dissolved and the tank disinfected with a food-safe solution before the final rinse.`},{step:4,title:`Refill & Verify`,desc:`The tank is refilled, left to aerate, and we check the water runs clear before we close the job.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does water tank cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`An overhead tank costs ₹399 and an underground tank ₹999, fixed on the confirmation call. Size and depth move the number — a 1,000-litre overhead tank sits above the standard rate, and a pit deeper than 1.5 metres needs a longer pump-out. Access to the terrace opening also affects the final quote.`},{q:`How long does a water tank cleaning take?`,a:`A standard overhead tank takes 60–90 minutes, including draining, scrubbing, disinfection and refilling. An underground pit tank takes 2–3 hours because the sludge has to be pumped out and the pit washed in sections. Two or three tanks in the same building are usually completed in a single visit.`},{q:`Do you disinfect the tank or only scrub it?`,a:`Both. Scrubbing alone leaves the algae film and bacteria behind, so the tank-safe alkaline clean is followed by a disinfection cycle and a full rinse. The solution used is food-safe and the tank is left to aerate before it is refilled and handed back.`},{q:`How often should a water tank be cleaned in Gurgaon?`,a:`Once every 3–6 months for overhead tanks, and after every heavy monsoon spell for underground pits. The dust load here is high enough that silt builds faster than in most cities, and a tank left untouched for a year visibly discolours the water.`},{q:`Is the tank safe for drinking water after cleaning?`,a:`Yes. We use food-safe products and the tank is rinsed until the water runs clear before refilling. Let the water stand overnight with the inlet closed and open it the next morning — the first glass can be slightly cloudy while the air bubbles settle, so many families use that for washing first.`},{q:`Can you clean a tank on a high-rise terrace?`,a:`Yes. The crew carries the hoses, pumps and cleaning solution up through the service lift or stairwell, and the tank lid is opened safely. Where the terrace hatch is locked or narrow, we coordinate with the society manager for access before the visit.`},{q:`Do you clean the pipes and the motor as well?`,a:`The inlet line is flushed and the outlet screen is checked as part of the job. Motor servicing, float replacement and leak repair are separate items — we show you what we found and quote it on its own rather than bundling it into the tank clean.`},{q:`Gurgaon me water tank cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Overhead tank ki cleaning ₹399 se aur underground tank ki ₹999 se hoti hai. Ek overhead tank ka kaam lagbhag 60–90 minute me ho jata hai. Chhote tank me dust zyada jama hota hai, isliye har 3–6 mahine me ek baar karwana behtar hai.`}],reviews:[],price:n.watertank},i={name:`Toilet Tank Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`The part of the toilet nobody cleans`,intro:`Toilet tank cleaning in Gurgaon clears scale, algae and bacteria from the hidden cistern behind your commode, fixes tanks that refill slowly and removes the odour a bowl wipe can never reach.`,detail:`The toilet tank is the one part of a bathroom nobody opens. Under the lid sits a ceramic or plastic cistern holding the water your family flushes with, and it collects scale, algae, rust stains and a biofilm around the flush valve and the overflow tube. It is also why flushes stop working properly: a scaled float and fill valve make a tank take two minutes to refill or run continuously. In a hard-water city like Gurgaon, that mineral build-up inside the tank is fast.

We shut off the supply valve, drain the cistern, then lift the tank off the bowl where the fixing allows it, so the underside and bowl seat get cleaned too. The seat, flush lever and hinges come off and are washed separately, the overflow tube is cleared with a flexible brush, and the float and fill valve are descaled. The interior is scrubbed with a descaler that dissolves Gurgaon’s crust without etching the glaze, disinfected, rinsed and reassembled. We test the flush, the refill and the leak seal before we leave.

Toilet tank cleaning is ₹499 per tank, and that covers the seat, the flush lever, the hinges, the interior scrub and the disinfection, with no add-on for the parts you cannot reach yourself. Two tanks are billed per tank, so a 2 BHK comes to ₹998. The price moves only if the tank has been running dry for months, in which case the fill valve often needs replacing; we show you the part and quote it before fitting anything.

We service toilet tanks across DLF Phase 1–5, Sector 45–57, Sushant Lok, Palam Vihar, Golf Course Road and Sohna Road societies, and the same ₹499 rate applies to staff washrooms in offices and clinics in Cyber City and Udyog Vihar. Most people book it alongside a [bathroom deep clean](/bathroom-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html), because the bowl, the tiles and the cistern are one connected system. A tank service every 6–8 months keeps the flush strong and the water clear.`,image:`/images/bathroom-deep-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Technician lifting the toilet cistern to scrub scale and disinfect the tank interior in a Gurgaon bathroom`,includes:[`Tank lid, seat and hinge removal`,`Interior scrub and scale dissolving`,`Flush lever and button cleaning`,`Overflow tube and flush valve clearing`,`Fill valve and float descaling`,`Disinfection with bathroom-safe solution`,`Bowl underside and seat area cleaning`,`Flush, refill and leak test after reassembly`],process:[{step:1,title:`Shut & Drain`,desc:`We close the supply valve, drain the cistern and lay down covers so nothing splashes the floor.`},{step:2,title:`Strip & Descale`,desc:`The seat, lever and hinges come off, and the scale on the tank walls is dissolved with a descaler.`},{step:3,title:`Disinfect`,desc:`The cistern, flush valve and overflow tube are disinfected and rinsed until the water runs clear.`},{step:4,title:`Reassemble & Test`,desc:`We refit the tank, test the flush and refill, and confirm the leak seal before signing off.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does toilet tank cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`₹499 per toilet tank, and that includes the seat, the flush lever, the hinges, the interior scrub and the disinfection. Two tanks in a 2 BHK come to ₹998, and there is no separate charge for dismantling the parts you cannot reach. The rate is fixed on the confirmation call.`},{q:`How long does a toilet tank cleaning take?`,a:`About 45–60 minutes per tank, including draining, descaling, disinfection and reassembly. A tank that has run dry for months takes longer because the fill valve has to be treated separately. Book two tanks together and we usually finish both in a little over two hours.`},{q:`Do you remove the tank from the bowl?`,a:`Yes, where the fixing allows it. Lifting the cistern lets us clean the underside, the bowl seat and the area around the flush pipe, which is where the worst of the staining sits. Where the tank is fixed tightly or the floor has been tiled over, we clean it in place and tell you what we could not reach.`},{q:`Why does my toilet tank take so long to refill?`,a:`Scale on the float and the fill valve is the usual reason, and the mineral content of Gurgaon’s water makes it worse. We descale both parts during the clean, which usually restores a normal refill. If the valve is worn out rather than scaled, we show you the part and quote the replacement separately.`},{q:`Does cleaning the tank make the water in the bowl cleaner?`,a:`Yes. The cistern is where the water sits longest, so a scaled tank is the source of the stains in the bowl and the odour in the bathroom. A clean tank plus a [bathroom deep clean](/bathroom-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html) removes the source and the visible residue in one visit.`},{q:`Is the disinfectant safe for a family bathroom?`,a:`Yes — we use a bathroom-grade disinfectant that is rinsed away completely, and the tank is refilled with fresh water before we leave. Keep the lid closed for the first hour so the solution stays in contact with the surfaces, then flush twice before anyone uses the bathroom.`},{q:`Can you clean the tanks in a commercial building?`,a:`Yes. The same ₹499 per tank rate applies to staff washrooms in offices, clinics and shops, and we work after hours or early mornings so the building is never out of service. For a building with many floors, we schedule the blocks tower by tower.`},{q:`Toilet tank ki cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Toilet tank ki cleaning ₹499 per tank hoti hai, jisme seat, flush lever, hinges aur interior ki safai aur disinfection shamil hai. Ek tank ka kaam 45–60 minute me ho jata hai. Tank band hone par paani bhi dheere bharta hai, toh flushing theek ho jati hai.`}],reviews:[],price:n.toilettank},a={name:`Window & Facade Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Glass that reflects the building, not the dust`,intro:`External window and facade cleaning in Gurgaon removes the grey dust haze and rain streaks that dull the face of a building, using cradle, boom-lift and rope-access methods matched to the height of your tower.`,detail:`The outside of a Gurgaon building collects what the city throws at it. Construction dust from the Dwarka Expressway corridor, soil from the open plots around Sohna Road, vehicle exhaust and highway grit all settle on glass and stay there through the dry months. A grey, spotted facade does more than look dull: it traps heat on the panes, and for an office tower or shop front it is the first impression a visitor forms.

External glass is cleaned the way it is accessed. At ground and second-floor level we use telescopic water-fed poles and a vacuum squeegee. From the third floor up we work from a maintenance cradle, a boom lift or a rope-access team, depending on the facade and what the society or facility manager approves. The sequence is the same at every height: a pre-rinse to knock off the grit, detergent applied with a soft sleeve, a second rinse, and a final squeegee pass that removes the water line. Frames, mullions and the ledges under each window are wiped too, because that dust re-splats the glass when it rains.

Facade and external glass cleaning is billed at ₹3 per square foot, and what matters is the glass area, not the built-up floor area. Add-ons such as hard-water stain removal are quoted per pane. Height changes the cost because it changes the access method: podium work uses poles, cradle and boom-lift work add a mobilisation and crew component, and rope access is quoted after a survey. The measured area and scope go out in writing before the visit.

We work across the towers and frontages of Gurgaon — DLF Phase 3 and 5 office blocks, Golf Course Road buildings, Sohna Road tech parks, MG Road showrooms, Cyber City glass boxes, and high-rises in Nirvana Country, Ardee City and Vatika City. Access approvals take longest, so book a tower needing a cradle or rope team a week ahead. Most facade clients pair the visit with a quarterly [office deep clean](/office-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html) for the interiors behind the glass.`,image:`/images/office-deep-cleaning.jpg`,imageAlt:`Crew cleaning external glass and facade panels of an office tower in Gurgaon from a cradle`,includes:[`External glass squeegee clean`,`Dust pre-rinse and detergent wash`,`Window frames and mullion wipe`,`Sill and ledge dust removal`,`Ground-level telescopic pole access`,`Cradle and boom-lift deployment`,`Rope access for high facade panels`,`Rain-stain and spot treatment per pane`,`Glass area measurement and written scope`],process:[{step:1,title:`Survey & Access`,desc:`We measure the glass area, check the access route and get society or facility approval.`},{step:2,title:`Pre-Rinse`,desc:`Loose grit is rinsed off first so the detergent does not drag dust across the pane.`},{step:3,title:`Wash & Squeegee`,desc:`Detergent is worked through with sleeves and the water is pulled off in a clean squeegee pass.`},{step:4,title:`Frames & Check`,desc:`Frames, sills and mullions are wiped, then every pane is checked for spots before sign-off.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does facade cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`External glass and facade cleaning is ₹3 per square foot of glass area. Add-ons such as removing hard-water stains from individual panes are billed per pane. The glass area is measured on a site survey and the scope is sent in writing before the visit, so the number does not move on the day.`},{q:`How long does facade cleaning take?`,a:`A ground-floor frontage of around 500 sq ft of glass takes 2–3 hours with a two-person crew. A full tower face of 5,000 sq ft of glass takes two to three working days, because the crew works bay by bay and the access equipment moves with them.`},{q:`Do you clean high-rise windows?`,a:`Yes. From the third floor up we work from a building maintenance cradle, a boom lift or a rope-access team, depending on the facade and what the society or facility manager approves. Access permissions take a few days, so a high-rise job is best booked at least a week ahead.`},{q:`What is the difference between facade cleaning and window cleaning?`,a:`Facade cleaning covers the outside of the building envelope — glass, frames, mullions, ledges and the shadow lines between floors. Inside window cleaning is a different job, usually part of a quarterly [office deep clean](/office-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html). A building usually needs the inside done more often than the outside.`},{q:`Can you remove hard-water stains from glass?`,a:`Most of them, yes. The mineral spots that form on Gurgaon glass are treated pane by pane with a spot remover and a light mechanical pass. Glass etched by years of scale, or damaged by a defective coating, cannot be restored — we tell you which panes are which before you pay for the treatment.`},{q:`Do you need water and power on site?`,a:`A water source is needed for the facade wash and a power point for the vacuum and the lift equipment. Where the building has a dedicated facade water line and a maintenance power outlet, the job runs faster and the access permit is simpler.`},{q:`How do you handle a pane that is already cracked?`,a:`We do not work a pane we cannot make safe, and we tell you on the survey instead of at the lift. Cracked or bonded panes are logged with photographs so you can have them replaced by your facade contractor before the next scheduled cycle.`},{q:`Gurgaon me facade cleaning ka rate kya hai?`,a:`Facade aur external glass ki cleaning ₹3 per sq ft hoti hai. Zameen se upar wale kaam ke liye cradle ya boom lift lagta hai, isliye height ke hisaab se price badh jaati hai. Pehle site survey karke glass area nikalte hain, phir likhit quote milta hai.`}],reviews:[],price:n.facade},o={name:`Common Area Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Lobbies, stairs and parking that look cared for`,intro:`Common area cleaning in Gurgaon keeps society lobbies, staircases, lift lobbies, parking aprons and clubhouses free of dust, cobwebs and stains, at ₹499 per visit or on a recurring plan.`,detail:`A society’s common areas are used by everyone and owned by no one. Dust settles in the lift lobby, leaves pile up in the corners of the stairs, cobwebs appear above the false ceiling in the lobby, and the parking apron collects oil marks and tyre dust. Residents notice it first when guests come over, and it drags the look of the whole tower down. That is why the best-kept homes in Gurgaon often sit in buildings where common areas are maintained on a schedule instead of fixed after a complaint.

A common area visit runs with industrial equipment, not a household kit. The crew starts at the top floor and works down, so dust falls once. Lobbies and corridors are dry swept with an industrial broom and vacuumed, cobwebs are cut down with extension lances, and the lift lobby and entrance mats are machine cleaned. Staircases get a solution-feed scrub on the treads and a separate mop for the landings. The parking apron is pressure washed where the surface allows it, leaves and paper are gathered, and bins are washed and sanitised with fresh liners.

Common area cleaning is ₹499 per visit, covering the lobby, the stairs, the lift lobby, the parking apron and the clubhouse. Daily and weekly schedules are quoted by area and shift hours rather than a flat per-visit number, because a 4 BHK tower and a 32-floor tower are not the same job. A periodic deep scrub — lifting ingrained marks out of a tiled lobby or the black build-up on stair nosings — is quoted separately.

We run common area contracts across DLF Phase 2–5, Sushant Lok 1–3, Nirvana Country, Ardee City, Vatika City, South City and the Sector 50–57 societies, and the same crew returns on the same day each week so residents learn who to reach. Cluster days work well for towers, where several blocks are cleaned in sequence. If the flats behind the doors also need work, our [deep cleaning services](/deep-cleaning-services-in-gurgaon.html) cover them the same week.`,image:`/images/office-deep-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Cleaning crew sweeping and scrubbing the tiled lobby and staircases of a Gurgaon apartment tower`,includes:[`Lobby and corridor dry sweeping`,`Industrial vacuuming of corners`,`Cobweb removal from ceilings and ducts`,`Staircase tread and landing scrub`,`Lift lobby and entrance mat cleaning`,`Parking apron pressure washing`,`Leaf, paper and waste collection`,`Bin washing with fresh liners`,`Clubhouse and recreation room upkeep`],process:[{step:1,title:`Scope the Tower`,desc:`We walk the floors, note the problem areas and fix what each visit covers.`},{step:2,title:`Top-Down Sweep`,desc:`Dust is cleared from the top floor downwards so it settles once, not twice.`},{step:3,title:`Scrub & Wash`,desc:`Stairs are solution-scrubbed and the parking apron is pressure washed where the surface allows.`},{step:4,title:`Check & Handover`,desc:`A supervisor walks the route with you and repeats anything that has been missed.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does common area cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`₹499 per visit covers the lobby, the stairs, the lift lobby, the parking apron and the clubhouse. Daily and weekly schedules are quoted by area and shift hours. A deep scrub of a tiled lobby or the build-up on stair nosings is a separate one-off job, quoted after we look at the surface.`},{q:`How long does one common area visit take?`,a:`A tower of 8–10 floors with two lifts and a parking apron takes about 2–3 hours for a two-person crew. Larger towers are split across more hours or a second crew, and the schedule is set out in the plan before the first visit.`},{q:`Can the same crew come every week?`,a:`Yes. We assign the same crew to the same tower on the same day each week, so residents know the faces and the routine stays consistent. If a member is unavailable, a substitute is briefed on the tower checklist and the change is informed to the society manager.`},{q:`Do you clean the lifts as well?`,a:`The lift lobby, the entrance mats and the landing floors are part of the common area visit. The cabin and the shaft internals are a separate service, handled under the lift vendor’s permission so the machinery is never touched while the lift is in service.`},{q:`Do you remove cobwebs from the false ceiling?`,a:`Yes. Cobwebs around the lobby ceiling, ducts, lights and beams are cut down with extension lances and the fallen dust is vacuumed immediately. In high-ceiling lobbies this is done with a taller pole, and in the monsoon the frequency goes up because of insects and moisture.`},{q:`Is the parking apron pressure washed?`,a:`Where the surface allows it, yes. Concrete aprons and ramps are pressure washed to lift the oil film and tyre dust. Tiled or painted surfaces get a solution scrub instead, because high water pressure can lift the joints or the paint on a coated floor.`},{q:`Can you handle a one-time deep clean of the common area?`,a:`Yes. A one-time reset of the lobby, stairs and clubhouse is quoted separately from the recurring visit, and it is the right booking before a festival, a handover or a new tenant move-in. After that, a weekly visit keeps the build-up from returning.`},{q:`Society ke common area ki cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Common area cleaning ₹499 per visit hoti hai — lobby, seedhiyan, lift lobby, parking aur clubhouse sab shamil hai. Daily ya weekly plan area aur shift hours ke hisaab se quote hota hai. Har visit ke liye same team aati hai, isliye residents ko routine ki aadat ho jaati hai.`}],reviews:[],price:n.commonarea},s={name:`Sweeper & Mop Cleaning Services in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Daily dust control, done properly every visit`,intro:`Sweeper and mop cleaning services in Gurgaon handle the daily grind — dry sweeping, wet mopping, floors and bins — at ₹499 per visit, or on a daily or weekly plan for homes, offices and shops.`,detail:`Sweeping and mopping is the daily hygiene layer of a home or an office, and it goes wrong in predictable ways. A dry broom pushes fine Gurgaon dust into corners and under furniture instead of lifting it, and a mop run with detergent leaves a film that turns grey and sticky within days. Dust that is not captured keeps circulating through the air and settles back on the beds and the cupboards. Done properly, one daily slot keeps a home ahead of the build-up instead of resetting it every month.

A sweeper-mop visit is a fixed sequence. Dry sweeping with a dust mop and a microfibre pad collects the loose grit from the floor, skirting, ledge and the corners under the beds, and a HEPA vacuum follows on carpets, curtains, sofa and mattress edges. Wet mopping comes next with a flat mop and a neutral, pH-balanced solution that leaves no film behind. Entrance mats are machine cleaned, kitchen and washroom surfaces are wiped and disinfected, and the waste is segregated, bagged and taken out.

A sweeper and mop visit is ₹499. Daily and weekly plans are quoted by the area and the number of shift hours rather than by one flat rate, because a 2 BHK needing two hours a day is a different commitment from a studio needing one. That ₹499 covers the crew, the equipment and the products, with no extra charge for our machine. Extra tasks such as window cleaning, fridge interiors or [sofa shampooing](/sofa-shampoo-cleaning-gurgaon.html) are booked as add-ons on the same visit.

We run sweeper-mop visits for homes in DLF Phase 1–5, Sushant Lok, South City, Palam Vihar, Sector 45–57, Golf Course Road and Sohna Road, and for offices, clinics, salons and shops in Cyber City, Udyog Vihar and MG Road. The same team returns on each visit, so the routine gets faster and the checklist does not change. After the monsoon, most clients add one [deep clean](/deep-cleaning-services-in-gurgaon.html) to reset the layers that daily visits cannot remove.`,image:`/images/house-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Sweeper and mop team cleaning the floors of a Gurgaon apartment during a scheduled house cleaning visit`,includes:[`Dry dust sweeping with microfibre pads`,`HEPA vacuuming of carpets and upholstery`,`Corner and under-furniture dust lifting`,`Flat-mop wet cleaning with neutral solution`,`Entrance and doormat machine cleaning`,`Kitchen and washroom surface disinfection`,`Waste segregation and daily disposal`,`Same crew on every scheduled visit`,`Weekly or daily plans by area`],process:[{step:1,title:`Confirm Checklist`,desc:`We agree the rooms, the add-ons and the fixed per-visit price before the first slot.`},{step:2,title:`Dry Sweep`,desc:`Loose dust is lifted from floors, ledges and corners with a dust mop and vacuum.`},{step:3,title:`Wet Mop`,desc:`Floors are mopped with a neutral solution that does not leave a sticky film behind.`},{step:4,title:`Sanitise & Check`,desc:`Touch points are disinfected, bins are changed and the walkthrough is done with you.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does a sweeper and mop visit cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`₹499 per visit for the standard home checklist. Daily and weekly schedules are quoted by area and shift hours, and a daily plan usually works out cheaper per visit than booking single slots. The crew, the equipment and the cleaning products are all included in that number.`},{q:`How long does one sweeper visit take?`,a:`A 1 BHK takes about 1.5–2 hours and a 2 BHK takes 2–3 hours. An office floor of around 1,000 sq ft takes 4–6 hours with a two-person crew. The time depends on the condition of the place, not only on its size.`},{q:`Is a sweeper different from a full-time maid?`,a:`Yes. A maid works to a fixed routine of chores, while a sweeper visit is a defined checklist with equipment and a fixed time slot. Most Gurgaon households pair a sweeper or a part-time helper for daily chores with a periodic [deep clean](/deep-cleaning-services-in-gurgaon.html) for the layers a daily visit cannot reach.`},{q:`Do you use the same person every time?`,a:`On weekly and daily schedules we assign the same crew to the same address, so they learn the layout and the preferences and the visit gets quicker. If someone is unavailable, a substitute is briefed on the checklist and the change is told to you in advance.`},{q:`Will my floors be safe after a wet mop?`,a:`Yes. We use a neutral, pH-balanced solution and a flat mop that leaves the floor damp rather than soaked, and the team moves room by room so nobody walks on a wet floor. Marble, wooden and vitrified surfaces each get the solution that suits them.`},{q:`Do you clean the kitchen and bathroom in a sweeper visit?`,a:`Yes — counters, sinks, taps, washbasins, mirrors and the toilet pan are wiped and disinfected as part of the standard checklist. A deep scrub of grout, the descaling of taps and the inside of cabinets belong to a deep clean, not to a daily visit.`},{q:`Do you take the waste out?`,a:`Yes. Daily waste is segregated into wet and dry, bagged and taken out at the end of the visit, and the bins are washed with fresh liners. Bulk or construction debris is not part of a sweeper visit and is quoted separately.`},{q:`Sweeper aur mop cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Ek sweeper visit ₹499 ka hota hai, jisme daily sweeping, mopping, dust aur bin change sab shamil hai. Daily ya weekly plan area aur shift hours ke hisaab se quote hota hai, aur us plan me per-visit cost kam ho jati hai.`}],reviews:[],price:n.sweeper},c={name:`Lift & Elevator Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Cabins, landings and shafts cleaned properly`,intro:`Lift and elevator cleaning in Gurgaon cleans the cabin, the landing floors, the call panels, the door sills and the shaft, so the first surface a visitor touches in your tower is a clean one.`,detail:`A lift cabin is the most-touched room in any building and the least cleaned. Shoe marks on the floor plate, handprints across the mirror, dust in the ceiling light diffuser and a dull film on the button panel that dozens of hands press daily. Landing floors collect the same treatment, and the door sill gathers the grit the rollers drag in with every trip. In the shaft and pit, dust, grease and old lubricant settle where nobody looks — and that is where a fault can start.

The cabin is cleaned with the lift on service mode and the doors held open. We lift the floor plate or mat, vacuum the track area, scrub the plate, and wipe the mirror, handrails, ceiling light and return panels. Buttons and the display are detailed without spraying liquid into the panel, and the doors are wiped where hands touch. Landing floors and call panels on every floor are done in one pass. The shaft and pit are inspected and cleaned with the lift vendor’s permission; the machine room stays with the maintenance company.

Lift and elevator cleaning is ₹1,499 per lift, covering the cabin, the landing floors and the shaft. One price covers a residential tower lift and a service lift in an office block, because the scope is the same three surfaces. What changes the number is the number of floors served, since every landing panel and sill is part of the job, and how long the cabin has gone uncleaned. Machine room and motor cleaning stay with the lift maintenance company.

We clean lifts in the residential towers of DLF Phase 1–5, Sushant Lok, Nirvana Country, Ardee City and the Sector 45–57 societies, and in the commercial lobbies of Cyber City, Udyog Vihar and Sohna Road. With several lifts, the schedule is planned so no floor goes long without service. If the building interior also needs work, the same visit can be paired with an [office deep clean](/office-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html) for the lobby around it.`,image:`/images/office-deep-cleaning.jpg`,imageAlt:`Cleaning crew wiping the mirror, handrail and button panel inside a lift cabin in a Gurgaon office building`,includes:[`Cabin interior scrub and vacuum`,`Mirror, handrail and panel detailing`,`Button panel and display cleaning`,`Floor plate and door sill wash`,`Door frame and track grit removal`,`Landing floors on every served level`,`Call panel and display wipe-down`,`Shaft and pit inspection and clean`,`Service-mode safety with lift staff`],process:[{step:1,title:`Vendor Access`,desc:`We agree the access window and get the lift vendor’s permission for the shaft work.`},{step:2,title:`Cabin Deep Clean`,desc:`The cabin is stripped down, scrubbed, vacuumed and detailed panel by panel.`},{step:3,title:`Landings & Sills`,desc:`Every landing floor, call panel and door sill is cleaned in one pass.`},{step:4,title:`Shaft & Handover`,desc:`The shaft and pit are checked with the lift on service mode, and the cabin is released.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does lift cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`₹1,499 per lift, covering the cabin, the landing floors and the shaft. The price holds for a residential tower lift and for a service lift in an office building, because the scope is the same three surfaces. What moves it is the number of floors served, since every landing panel and sill is part of the job.`},{q:`How long does one lift take to clean?`,a:`A cabin with landings on 8–10 floors takes about 2–3 hours for a two-person crew. A high-rise with 25 floors and more landings takes half a day. The cabin is out of service only while the crew is working inside it, and the rest of the building carries on using the other lifts.`},{q:`Is the lift taken out of service during cleaning?`,a:`Only for the period the crew is working inside the cabin, and it is put on service mode so the doors stay open. Shaft and pit work is done with the lift parked and the vendor informed, in line with the maintenance schedule your society or facility manager follows.`},{q:`Do you clean the landing buttons and door sills?`,a:`Yes — the call panels, the landing floors and the door sills on every level the lift serves are included. The sill is where grit collects and gets dragged inside, so it is scrubbed rather than wiped, and the grime behind the button panel is detailed out.`},{q:`Can you clean the machine room and motor?`,a:`No — the machine room, the motor and the control system stay with the lift maintenance company. We clean the shaft and pit area and report anything we notice, such as oil or dust on the guide rails, so the vendor can act on it.`},{q:`How often should a lift be cleaned?`,a:`Monthly for a residential tower and fortnightly for a busy commercial lobby where a few hundred people use the lift every day. A quarterly deep detail of the cabin adds value in offices where the floor plate and the ceiling light diffuser need it.`},{q:`Do you clean service lifts and goods lifts?`,a:`Yes. Service and goods lifts get the same cabin, landing and shaft scope, with the added wear of trolleys and loads. The rate is the same ₹1,499 per lift, and floors with heavy industrial use are quoted with a longer service window.`},{q:`Lift cleaning ka kharcha kya hai Gurgaon me?`,a:`Lift aur elevator cleaning ₹1,499 per lift hoti hai — cabin, landing floors aur shaft teeno shamil hain. 8–10 floors wale lift me kaam lagbhag 2–3 ghante me ho jata hai. Machine room aur motor cleaning lift maintenance company karti hai, hum use touch nahi karte.`}],reviews:[],price:n.lift},l={name:`Window Grill Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Grills and mesh cleared of dust and webs`,intro:`Window grill cleaning in Gurgaon pulls dust, bird droppings and spider webbing out of window grills and mesh, so the air moves freely through the window again and the frames stop grinding with grit.`,detail:`The window grill is the most neglected surface in a Gurgaon flat. It sits outside, so it collects road dust, pollen, dead insects and bird droppings, and the mesh behind it becomes a filter that blocks the airflow. Dust also works into the joints and sliding channels, where it grinds the frame every time the window moves. On floors facing Golf Course Road or the open plots around Sohna Road, the deposit is heavy enough that the grill reads grey, not black.

Grill cleaning needs more than a wet cloth, so we bring a mesh brush and a wet-vacuum setup that pulls dust out of the grid instead of pushing it around. The grill is dry brushed first, then the mesh is washed with detergent while the vacuum holds the dirty water at the frame bottom, and the frame and channels wiped. Droppings are treated one by one with a spotting solution so they do not etch the powder coating, and light rust on the joints is treated too. The sill is cleaned and dried before the window closes.

Window grill cleaning is ₹399 per window, covering the grill, the mesh and the sill. The rate is per window, not per square foot, because a wide bedroom grill and a narrow kitchen window take the same time. What changes it is access: a window reachable from inside the room is quicker than one needing a balcony ladder or service balcony, and a grill on the fourth floor or above with no service balcony is quoted after a site visit.

We clean window grills across DLF Phase 1–5, Sushant Lok, Palam Vihar, Golf Course Road, Sohna Road and the Sector 45–57 societies, and in offices along Cyber City and Udyog Vihar where frontage grills take traffic dust. Most people add it to a quarterly [deep clean](/deep-cleaning-services-in-gurgaon.html) so grills, windows and balconies are done together. Grills in high-rise flats are best cleaned before the monsoon, when the mesh is dry and the dust has not turned to grit.`,image:`/images/house-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Technician brushing dust out of a window grill and mesh in a Gurgaon apartment, vacuum hose in use`,includes:[`Grill mesh dry brushing and dust lifting`,`Mesh wash with wet-vacuum extraction`,`Bird dropping spot treatment`,`Frame and sliding channel cleaning`,`Rust spot removal on joints`,`Window sill and ledge wipe-down`,`Frame and hinge lubrication check`,`Window track grit removal`],process:[{step:1,title:`Check Access`,desc:`We confirm the window type, the reach and whether a ladder or a balcony is needed.`},{step:2,title:`Dry Brush`,desc:`Loose dust is brushed off the mesh so it does not turn into wet grit.`},{step:3,title:`Wash & Extract`,desc:`The mesh is washed with detergent while the vacuum captures the dirty water.`},{step:4,title:`Frame & Sill`,desc:`Frames, channels and sills are wiped and dried before the window closes.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does window grill cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`₹399 per window, covering the grill, the mesh and the sill. The rate is per window, not per square foot, because a wide bedroom grill and a narrow kitchen window take almost the same time. Access changes the price: a window that needs a balcony ladder or a service balcony is quoted after a site visit.`},{q:`How long does grill cleaning take per window?`,a:`About 30–45 minutes for a standard bedroom or living-room window with the mesh and the sill included. A kitchen window with heavy grease on the frame takes a little longer. Four to six windows of the same flat are usually done in under three hours.`},{q:`Will the grill not get scratched?`,a:`No. We use a soft nylon mesh brush and a detergent solution instead of steel wire, so the powder coating on aluminium grills is not abraded. Where rust has already broken the coating, we treat the rust spot and tell you which sections need repainting.`},{q:`Can bird droppings be removed completely?`,a:`Usually yes, if they are treated rather than scrubbed. Each dropping is wetted with a spotting solution so the deposit does not etch the coating, and the residue is lifted with a non-abrasive pad. Droppings left for years can leave a shadow mark that lightens but does not always disappear.`},{q:`Do you clean the window glass as well?`,a:`The grill, the mesh and the sill are the standard scope, and the glass is cleaned when you add a window package. Many flats book both together, because the team is already set up at the window and the glass takes minutes more.`},{q:`Is it safe to clean a grill on a high floor?`,a:`Yes, with the right access. Grills on the lower floors are cleaned from inside the room, and higher floors with a service balcony are done from the balcony with a stable platform. Where there is no safe access from either side, we say so on the call instead of sending someone out on a stool.`},{q:`How often should window grills be cleaned?`,a:`Every 3–6 months for most Gurgaon flats, and twice a year for homes facing a dusty road. The build-up you can see from inside the room is usually a third of what is packed into the mesh, so cleaning it before the mesh starts holding damp and rusting the joints is worth it.`},{q:`Window grill cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Window grill cleaning ₹399 per window hoti hai, jisme grill, mesh aur sill teeno shamil hain. Ek window ka kaam 30–45 minute me ho jata hai. Fourth floor se upar wale grill me balcony access chahiye hota hai, isliye pehle site visit ke baad price confirm hoti hai.`}],reviews:[],price:n.windowgrill},u={name:`Kitchen Utensils Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Vessels, cookware and cutlery stripped clean`,intro:`Kitchen utensils cleaning in Gurgaon removes burnt carbon, polymerised oil and tarnish from pots, pans, pressure cookers and cutlery, so your vessels stop cooking old oil back into the food.`,detail:`The inside of a kitchen is where cooking oil collects and polymerises. A kadhai used for frying every evening develops a black carbon layer that flakes into the food, a tawa holds burnt residue around the base, and a pressure cooker collects scale around the gasket and vent. Stainless steel picks up water spots and heat tint that dull the whole shelf. These are not problems you can wipe away — the carbon has to be broken down chemically and then physically, a different job from wiping a counter.

We sort the vessels first: stainless steel, aluminium, non-stick, brass and glass each need their own treatment. The job starts with dry scraping to lift off loose burnt flakes, then the utensils go into a hot alkaline degreaser bath that loosens the polymerised oil. Carbon is worked off with a stainless scrubber on hard surfaces, while non-stick pans get a non-abrasive method that will not scratch the coating. Brass and copper get a gentler product, gaskets and vents are cleaned with a small brush, and everything gets a hot-water rinse and air dry.

Kitchen utensils cleaning starts at ₹409. The number depends on the load: a typical set of around 20 pieces — a kadhai, a tawa, two pots, a pressure cooker, plates and cutlery — sits at the starting rate, while a kitchen with 40 or more vessels is quoted on count and carbon. What moves the price fastest is the carbon: a vessel never cleaned needs the bath time and scrubbing it cannot get in a sink.

We clean utensils for homes across DLF Phase 1–5, Sohna Road, Golf Course Road, Sushant Lok and the Sector 45–57 societies, and for PG hostels and small commercial kitchens in MG Road and Cyber City. Most people book it with a [kitchen deep clean](/kitchen-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html) so the chimney, cabinets and vessels are done in one visit. Before Diwali, when the full kitchen set comes out of the cupboards, this is the season’s most requested job.`,image:`/images/kitchen-deep-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Degreaser bath and scrubbing of kadai, tawa and pressure cooker during kitchen utensils cleaning in a Gurgaon home`,includes:[`Dry scraping of burnt carbon flakes`,`Hot alkaline degreaser bath treatment`,`Carbon removal on tawa and kadhai`,`Non-abrasive treatment for non-stick pans`,`Pressure cooker gasket and vent cleaning`,`Steel tarnish and water-spot removal`,`Cutlery and knife blade polishing`,`Hot-water rinse and air drying`],process:[{step:1,title:`Sort & Count`,desc:`We separate steel, non-stick, brass and glass so each batch gets its own treatment.`},{step:2,title:`Soak & Degrease`,desc:`Vessels go into a hot degreaser bath that loosens the burnt oil and carbon.`},{step:3,title:`Scrub & Rinse`,desc:`Carbon is scrubbed off, then everything is rinsed in hot water and dried.`},{step:4,title:`Inspect & Return`,desc:`Each piece is checked for remaining carbon and returned in clean condition.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does kitchen utensil cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`It starts at ₹409 for a standard load of around 20 pieces — a kadhai, a tawa, pots, a pressure cooker, plates and cutlery. The price moves with the count and, more than anything, with the carbon: a vessel that has never been soaked needs the bath time and the scrubbing that a maintained one does not.`},{q:`How long does utensil cleaning take?`,a:`A standard load of 20 to 25 pieces takes about 90 minutes, including the soak, the scrubbing and the drying. A 40-piece kitchen with heavy carbon on the tawa and kadhai takes closer to two and a half hours. We work in batches, so the sink is never blocked for the whole job.`},{q:`Will the scrubbing damage my non-stick pans?`,a:`No. Non-stick cookware gets a non-abrasive treatment — a warm degreaser bath, a soft pad and a rinse, with no steel wool and no scraping tool on the coating. Tell us on the booking which pieces are non-stick, and they are separated from the stainless steel batch.`},{q:`Can the burnt carbon on a kadhai be removed fully?`,a:`Most of it can. The carbon is broken down with a hot alkaline bath and lifted with a stainless scrubber, which restores most of the original surface. Where the carbon has corroded the metal itself, that layer cannot be removed completely, and we tell you which vessels are in that state.`},{q:`Do you clean brass and copper vessels?`,a:`Yes, but they are treated separately. Brass and copper get a gentler product and a soft cloth, because an alkaline degreaser and a hard scrub will strip the patina and dull the metal. The carbon comes off more slowly, so we allow extra time for those pieces.`},{q:`Do you clean the pressure cooker gasket?`,a:`Yes — the gasket, the vent pipe and the safety valve are cleaned with a small brush and degreaser, and the seal is checked while the cooker is apart. A gasket that has hardened is usually replaced rather than cleaned, and we show you the part before quoting it.`},{q:`Can you clean utensils for a commercial kitchen?`,a:`Yes. Restaurant and cloud-kitchen vessels in MG Road, Sohna Road and Cyber City are quoted on the count and the volume of the carbon, and the work is scheduled outside the cooking hours. Continuous-kitchen vessels need a weekly arrangement rather than an occasional reset.`},{q:`Kitchen utensils ki safai ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Utensils cleaning ₹409 se shuru hoti hai, jisme kadhai, tawa, bartan, cooker aur cutlery shamil hai. 20–25 pieces ka kaam lagbhag 90 minute me ho jata hai. Jo bartan bahut purana ho aur usme jaldi jal ke pakka hua ho, uski cleaning me thoda zyada time lagta hai.`}],reviews:[],price:n.utensils},d={name:`Road & Street Sweeping in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Internal roads swept, dust removed, debris gone`,intro:`Road and street sweeping in Gurgaon clears construction dust, silt and leaf litter from internal roads, driveways and commercial lane approaches, with the debris loaded, taken out and disposed of properly off site.`,detail:`Gurgaon builds fast, and the dust shows up on the road first. Silt washed off open plots and construction sites during the monsoon settles into the kerbs and low spots, tyres grind it into the surface, and by winter the internal roads of a society look grey even after a sweep. There is the everyday layer too — leaves, paper, plastic and the grit cars carry from the main road. Sweeping pushes that grit to the edges rather than removing it, so it returns with the next vehicle.

The work depends on the surface and the area. A wide internal road is swept with a tractor-mounted or truck-mounted suction sweeper that lifts dust into a hopper, while kerb lines, corners and the spaces under parked cars are cleared by hand with a road brush. Where water is available, the surface is dampened first so the dust binds instead of floating. The collected material is loaded, taken out of the site and disposed of properly — not tipped at the corner of the road, where wind would carry it back.

Road and street sweeping is ₹6 per square foot, covering the sweeping, the dust removal and disposal. The cost is driven by the area and the equipment needed to cover it, not by the number of workers. A narrow lane needs a smaller machine and takes longer per square foot than a wide road. Monthly and weekly schedules use the same rate with a fixed service window, and one-off pre-festival or post-monsoon sweeps are booked the same.

We sweep internal roads and driveway aprons in the societies of DLF Phase 1–5, Nirvana Country, Ardee City, Vatika City and the Sector 50–57 sectors, and in the commercial complexes along Sohna Road, Golf Course Road and Cyber City. Longer stretches through an industrial or market lane are quoted after a site visit. Most clients run a monthly sweep, add a pre-festival visit and pair it with a [deep cleaning visit](/deep-cleaning-services-in-gurgaon.html) so lobby and road reset together.`,image:`/images/office-deep-cleaning.jpg`,imageAlt:`Sweeping machine and crew clearing silt and leaf litter from an internal road in a Gurgaon residential complex`,includes:[`Suction sweeping of internal roads`,`Hand clearing of kerbs and corners`,`Space under parked cars swept`,`Water dampening to settle dust`,`Leaf, paper and debris collection`,`Material loaded and removed from site`,`Driveway and service lane coverage`,`Monthly or scheduled sweep windows`],process:[{step:1,title:`Survey the Route`,desc:`We measure the length, width and surface, and check where the machine can go.`},{step:2,title:`Dampen & Sweep`,desc:`The surface is wetted so the dust binds, then swept into the collection hopper.`},{step:3,title:`Hand Corners`,desc:`Kerbs, corners and the space under the parked cars are cleared by hand.`},{step:4,title:`Load & Dispose`,desc:`The collected debris is loaded, taken out and disposed of away from the site.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does road sweeping cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`₹6 per square foot, covering the sweeping, the dust removal and the disposal of the collected material. The rate is per square foot because the cost comes from the area and the equipment needed to cover it. Monthly and weekly schedules use the same rate with a fixed service window.`},{q:`How long does sweeping 5,000 sq ft of internal road take?`,a:`About 3–4 hours with a two-person crew and a suction sweeper. The kerbs, the corners and the space under parked cars are done by hand, which is the slower part of the job. A wider road clears faster per square foot because the machine can run in a straight pass.`},{q:`Do you remove the collected dust from the site?`,a:`Yes — disposal is included in the per-square-foot rate. The debris is loaded, taken out of the site and dumped at an authorised facility, not left at the corner of the road. That last part matters for residential societies, where wind carries loose dust straight back into the flats.`},{q:`Do you sweep after the monsoon?`,a:`Yes, and it is the most useful time of the year. Rain washes silt and soil off open plots and construction sites onto the roads, and it packs into the kerbs where a broom cannot reach it. Book the first post-monsoon sweep in September, before the layer hardens.`},{q:`Is water used during sweeping?`,a:`Where a water point is available, the surface is dampened before sweeping so the dust binds to the road instead of lifting into the air. On dry stretches the suction machine still captures the loose grit, and the crew works at a lower speed to keep the dust down.`},{q:`Can you do a one-off sweep before a festival or an event?`,a:`Yes, and it is the most common single booking. A one-off sweep of the internal roads and the driveway apron is priced on the same per-square-foot rate. Book it a few days ahead, because the demand spikes before Diwali and after the monsoon.`},{q:`Do you clean the parking area as well?`,a:`The parking apron is included where it forms part of the measured internal road area. Loose soil, oil spots and leaf litter are cleared, and the surface is dampened and swept. Oil marks that need degreasing are quoted as a separate add-on rather than folded into the sweep rate.`},{q:`Road sweeping ka kharcha kya hai Gurgaon me?`,a:`Road aur street sweeping ₹6 per sq ft hoti hai, jisme safai, dhool hatana aur garbage bahar dump karna shamil hai. 5,000 sq ft ke internal road me 3–4 ghante lagte hain. Baarish ke baad September me ek sweep karwana sabse zyada faayda deta hai.`}],reviews:[],price:n.road},f={name:`Chandelier & High-Reach Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Crystal drops and high glass, cleaned safely`,intro:`Chandelier and high-reach cleaning in Gurgaon dusts and cleans crystal fixtures, glass and brass arms, using boom lifts and pole access for the heights a ladder cannot safely reach in your tower.`,detail:`A chandelier collects dust the way a ceiling fan does, but the dust is on glass, and glass shows every fingerprint of it. Crystal drops dull, brass arms darken, the canopy collects a layer on top, and the bulbs are usually missed for years. The same applies to the high glass and the light fittings in a lobby or a double-height living room. In Gurgaon the dust mixes road particulate with construction fines, so it settles fast.

Every drop is handled by hand. Our cleaners wear cotton gloves and use a dry micro-duster first, so grit is lifted off the crystal instead of dragged across it. The glass is then wiped with a lightly dampened microfibre, using distilled water where available so it dries without spotting, and the brass arms with a matched product. Bulb holders and the canopy are detailed separately, and the fitting is reassembled before it is switched on. Over a staircase or a high ceiling, a boom lift or a pole set-up from the floor is used.

Chandelier and high-reach cleaning is ₹1,499 per unit for a crystal or glass fixture, with high-reach access included. The rate is per fixture, not per bulb, so a heavy multi-arm chandelier in a lobby and a small pendant in a flat are charged the same way; what changes it is the access method and the height, since a 12th-floor balcony fixture needs a rope-access team quoted separately. High glass around a fixture is quoted per pane.

We clean chandeliers and high-reach fittings across the high-rise flats of DLF Phase 5, Nirvana Country, Ardee City and Vatika City, and in the lobbies of offices and hotels on Golf Course Road, Sohna Road and Cyber City. Most clients book the fixtures twice a year, before the festival season and after the monsoon. In a flat with a multi-arm fixture over the dining table, it pairs well with a [full home deep clean](/deep-cleaning-services-in-gurgaon.html) so the fittings and the rest of the home are done in one visit.`,image:`/images/full-home-4bhk-deep-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Cleaner in cotton gloves wiping the crystal drops and brass arms of a chandelier in a Gurgaon villa`,includes:[`Dry micro-dusting of crystal drops`,`Glass and crystal spot-free wiping`,`Brass and metal arm polishing`,`Canopy and ceiling rose cleaning`,`Bulb holder and fitting detailing`,`High-reach access with boom lift`,`Surrounding high glass dust removal`,`Furniture protection below the fixture`],process:[{step:1,title:`Assess Access`,desc:`We check the fixture, the height and what can be reached from the floor.`},{step:2,title:`Dry Dust`,desc:`Crystal and glass are micro-dusted by hand so grit is not dragged across them.`},{step:3,title:`Wipe & Polish`,desc:`The glass is wiped with a damp cloth and the metal arms are polished to match.`},{step:4,title:`Reassemble`,desc:`Bulbs, shades and covers are refitted and the fitting is tested on.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does chandelier cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`₹1,499 per unit for a crystal or glass chandelier, with the high-reach access included. The rate is per fixture rather than per bulb. What changes the number is the access: a fixture on the ground floor or a low balcony is straightforward, while a high-rise fixture needing a rope-access team is quoted separately.`},{q:`How long does one chandelier take to clean?`,a:`About 60–90 minutes for a standard multi-arm crystal fixture, including the dusting, the wipe-down and the reassembly. A large lobby fixture with several hundred drops takes half a day, because every drop is handled by hand. The power to the fitting is switched off for the job.`},{q:`Do you dismantle the chandelier?`,a:`Only where the fixing allows it and the client approves. Bulbs, shades and the canopy come off for cleaning, and the drops are wiped in place unless the fitting can be safely lowered. Anything needing dismantling beyond that is referred to a specialist rather than improvised.`},{q:`Can you clean a high glass panel above a lobby?`,a:`Yes, using a boom lift or a pole set-up from the floor, depending on the height and the clearance around the panel. Surrounding high glass is quoted per pane. We lay protection on the floor below and work at a controlled speed so nothing is dropped.`},{q:`Will the crystal drops get scratched?`,a:`No. Every drop is handled with cotton gloves and a dry micro-duster, and the wiping is done with a lightly damp microfibre rather than a wet cloth. We never spray directly onto the crystal, because the liquid can run down the wire and leave a mark on the fitting.`},{q:`How often should a chandelier be cleaned?`,a:`Twice a year for most homes and lobbies — once before the festival season and once after the monsoon. A chandelier over a dining table in a kitchen-adjacent room collects grease film as well as dust, and that needs the second clean to come in sooner.`},{q:`Do you clean the ceiling fans and light fittings as well?`,a:`Yes, high-reach light fittings are handled in the same visit, and ceiling fans can be added so the blades and the canopy are wiped with the same crew and the same setup. A [deep clean](/deep-cleaning-services-in-gurgaon.html) covers the fan blades and the switchboards at the same level.`},{q:`Chandelier cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Chandelier aur high-reach cleaning ₹1,499 per unit hoti hai, jisme crystal, glass aur high-reach access shamil hai. Ek fixture 60–90 minute me saaf hota hai. Agar fixture 12th floor par hai aur rope access chahiye, toh uska price alag quote hota hai.`}],reviews:[],price:n.chandelier},p={name:`Washing Machine Deep Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Strip the gunk out of your washing machine`,intro:`Washing machine deep cleaning in Gurgaon removes the detergent scum, lint and bacteria trapped in the drum, filter and door seal — the parts you cannot reach when the machine starts smelling or washing badly.`,detail:`Most washing machines look clean and are not. Detergent residue, body oil, hair and lint mat together inside the drum, settle in the filter housing and lodge in the rubber door seal, where they start to smell within weeks of every fresh load. Front-loaders are worse because the gasket holds moisture; top-loaders trap debris under the agitator. Cleaning the outside is pointless while that layer stays — it is what makes clothes smell and why the machine starts throwing an error mid-cycle.

Our washing machine deep cleaning takes the machine apart further than the manual shows. We pull the drum out, lift the filter, open the detergent drawer and flush the inlet hose, then scrub the drum, gasket and inlet housing with a detergent-dissolving solution under heat. The seal is wiped with a mildew-safe cleaner and the machine is run through two rinse cycles so the loosened residue leaves the system. Front-load and top-load both get the same dismantling steps, adjusted to the model.

The price is ₹799 per unit, whether it is a front-load or a top-load, and each machine takes 90–120 minutes. The price moves up only when the machine is stacked under a counter and must be pulled out, when the drain hose is blocked and needs clearing, or when the gasket has been left damp so long that the rubber has cracked. Two machines in the same home are charged per unit, and the second one finishes faster because the crew is already set up.

We run washing machine deep cleaning across DLF Phase 2 and 3, Sector 43 and 57, Golf Course Road, Sohna Road, Palam Vihar, Sushant Lok 1 and the older colonies in New Colony and MG Road, where most homes have a stacked top-load or an old front-load. Book it alongside a [full home deep clean](/deep-cleaning-services-in-gurgaon.html) and the drum, filter and seal come back to the same standard as the rest of the house.`,image:`/images/bathroom-deep-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Technician deep cleaning a front-load washing machine drum and door seal in a Gurgaon apartment`,includes:[`Drum, filter & door-seal scrub`,`Detergent drawer and inlet flush`,`Top-load agitator deep clean`,`Gasket mould and mildew removal`,`Drain hose and sump clearing`,`Two full rinse cycles run`,`Inner tub and back-panel wipe`,`Panel and control knob detailing`,`Machine moved out and replaced`],process:[{step:1,title:`Assess`,desc:`We check the model, door type and access space before quoting the job.`},{step:2,title:`Dismantle`,desc:`Drum, filter, drawer and seal are opened and taken apart for cleaning.`},{step:3,title:`Scrub`,desc:`Every part is scrubbed with a detergent-dissolving solution and then rinsed clean.`},{step:4,title:`Test Run`,desc:`The machine is reassembled and run through two rinse cycles to verify it.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does washing machine deep cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`₹799 per machine, whether front-load or top-load, with the drum, filter and door seal all included. The final price changes only if the machine is stacked under a counter and has to be pulled out, the drain hose is blocked and needs clearing, or the rubber seal has cracked and needs replacement. The rate is confirmed on the call before we start.`},{q:`How long does one machine take?`,a:`90–120 minutes per machine, depending on the model and how heavy the buildup is. A top-load agitator with a thick lint mat takes longer than a front-load drum, because the parts have to be soaked before they can be scrubbed. Two machines in the same home take about three hours in total, since the crew sets up once and works through them back to back.`},{q:`Is it safe for my machine?`,a:`Yes. We use alkaline detergent-dissolving solutions that suit stainless steel, plastic and rubber drum parts, and we never use acids on the glass door or the seal. Before starting we run a small test on a hidden section of the gasket. A machine with an inverter board is cleaned with the power disconnected at the plug.`},{q:`Will the smell go away?`,a:`In most cases yes, because the odour comes from bacteria feeding on the residue in the gasket and filter housing, and both are physically cleaned rather than sprayed over. If the smell returns within a week, the source is usually the drain hose or the inlet plumbing rather than the drum. We also check the machine sits level, since a tilted drum traps water and breeds smell.`},{q:`Washing machine ki deep cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Washing machine deep cleaning ₹799 per machine hoti hai, front-load aur top-load dono ke liye same rate. Drum, filter aur door seal ke saath detergent drawer aur drain pipe bhi saaf hote hain. Time lagta hai 90–120 minutes per machine.`},{q:`Do you clean top-load and front-load both?`,a:`Both, and the method is the same in principle: dismantle, soak, scrub, rinse and run. Top-loads get the agitator lifted out and the underside of the tub opened, because debris collects there and starts to smell. Front-loads get the door gasket pulled back so the fold at the bottom can be scrubbed. Both include the filter and the detergent drawer in the standard price.`},{q:`How often should a washing machine be deep cleaned?`,a:`Once every 6–8 months for a normal household, and every 3–4 months if you wash towels daily, have children in the house or run large loads of bedsheets. In Gurgaon, the extra dust that settles on open drying clothes finds its way back into the drum, so shorter intervals pay for themselves in odour. Book it alongside your quarterly home clean so one visit covers both.`},{q:`Do you move the machine out of the alcove?`,a:`We pull the machine forward, clean the floor and wall behind it where it sits, and put it back exactly where it was. If it is stacked under a counter, the counter has to be lifted and the hoses disconnected first, and that extra effort is quoted before the job starts. Corner installs with very tight clearance take a little longer.`},{q:`Do you clean the dryer or the AC filter too?`,a:`The washing machine only. Dryer duct cleaning and AC filter cleaning are separate services because they involve different equipment and different risk. If you want all three in one visit, ask for them as add-ons on the booking call and we send one crew with the right kit.`}],reviews:[],price:n.washingmachine},m={name:`Chair & Recliner Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Fresh seats without buying new chairs`,intro:`Chair and recliner cleaning in Gurgaon extracts dust, sweat marks and food spills from office chairs, gaming seats and recliners, so a seat that has absorbed years of use feels new again without the cost of a replacement.`,detail:`An office chair is the least-maintained surface in a Gurgaon home or office: it is sat on, never washed, and it drinks sweat, dust and food from every break. Foam holds that load inside the cushion, where a wipe never reaches, so the seat smells, the backrest darkens and the mesh turns brittle. Extraction resets the seat instead of hiding the problem under a fabric spray.

We vacuum the chair with a crevice and upholstery tool to pull dry dust out of the seams and underside, then pre-treat each stain with a fabric-appropriate solution and let it sit. Hot-water low-moisture extraction flushes the foam, and the dirty water is sucked out rather than left to soak in. Armrests, the under-seat pan, the mechanism housing and the wheels are wiped separately, and directed airflow dries the seat for use the same evening.

The rate is ₹199 per chair and each one takes 45–60 minutes, so a set of four office chairs is a half-day job. The price moves when the fabric is leather or perforated mesh and needs a different treatment, when a spill has dyed the seat and needs extra dwell, when it is a recliner with a powered footrest we check before lifting the back, and when the chair is dragged out from under a desk. A chair and a recliner cleaned on the same visit are charged per seat, with no visit fee.

We clean chairs across DLF Phase 2 and 3 homes, Sushant Lok 1 and Palam Vihar apartments, and the office floors in Cyber City, Udyog Vihar and Golf Course Road, where a shared desk chair is cleaned with the workstation. For societies and clinics we do a batch of seating on one visit so the cost per chair comes down. If the same seats need attention on a schedule, pair this with an [office deep clean](/office-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html) and the extraction kit comes once.`,image:`/images/sofa-shampoo-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Office chair and recliner upholstery extraction in progress, vacuum hose lifting dust from the seat cushion`,includes:[`Full crevice vacuum before treatment`,`Stain pre-treatment by fabric type`,`Hot-water low-moisture extraction`,`Foam, cushion and backrest rinse`,`Armrest and under-seat sanitisation`,`Mechanism and base wipe-down`,`Leather and mesh safe treatment`,`Airflow drying before we leave`],process:[{step:1,title:`Check Fabric`,desc:`We identify the cover material and note which stains need extra dwell time.`},{step:2,title:`Vacuum`,desc:`Dry dust is pulled out of the seams, underside and mechanism housing.`},{step:3,title:`Extract`,desc:`Pre-treated stains are lifted with hot-water extraction on a low-moisture setting only.`},{step:4,title:`Dry`,desc:`Direct airflow dries the seat so it is usable again the same evening.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does chair cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`₹199 per chair for standard extraction, and each chair takes 45–60 minutes. Four office chairs cleaned together take about three hours, so a full desk set is usually done inside one working day. Leather and perforated mesh covers are treated differently but stay on the same per-chair rate unless the fabric needs specialist products.`},{q:`How long does one chair take?`,a:`45–60 minutes per chair, most of which is drying time we do not have to wait for — you can move the chair back into use while it dries. A recliner with a powered footrest takes longer because the mechanism has to be checked before the back is lifted. Office chairs tucked under a desk add a few minutes each for moving.`},{q:`Can you clean a leather chair?`,a:`Yes, but not with shampoo. Leather is cleaned with a leather-safe cleaner and then conditioned, which removes surface grime and slows the cracking that comes with age. We tell you before starting if the leather is already peeling or heavily creased, because no cleaning will restore that.`},{q:`Will old stains come out?`,a:`Most food, tea and dust marks lift completely. Marks from ink, permanent dye or bleach sit in the dye itself and cannot be pulled out — they lighten, they do not disappear. We test the hidden underside of the seat first, so you know the honest result before the whole chair is done.`},{q:`Do you clean gaming chairs?`,a:`Yes. Gaming chairs have PU leather, perforated panels and quilted seams, and we clean the seat, backrest, headrest and lumbar cushion as one unit. The frame and the tilt mechanism are wiped down as well, which is where the grime collects around the adjustment levers and the wheel base.`},{q:`Do you clean office chairs in bulk?`,a:`Yes. For a floor of twenty desks we send a larger crew and finish in one evening or over a weekend, cleaning the chair and the workstation together. Bookings for Cyber City, Udyog Vihar and Golf Course Road offices are scheduled after hours, so nobody has to work around a cleaning crew.`},{q:`Office chair ki cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Chair cleaning ₹199 per chair hoti hai aur har chair pe 45–60 minutes lagte hain. Chaar chairs ek saath karwane me lagbhag teen ghante lagte hain. Recliners aur leather chairs bhi isi rate me clean ho jaate hain.`},{q:`Is it worth cleaning a chair or should I replace it?`,a:`Clean it first. A structurally sound chair with faded fabric almost always looks markedly better after extraction, because the darkness you see is embedded soil rather than worn material. If the foam has collapsed, the tilt mechanism has failed or the cover is torn, cleaning will not help, and we will say so honestly on the inspection.`}],reviews:[],price:n.chairclean},h={name:`Curtain Vacuum & Shampoo Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Shampoo your curtains without replacing them`,intro:`Curtain vacuum and shampoo cleaning in Gurgaon lifts the dust, smoke and sun-bleached grime out of curtain folds — panels vacuumed, shampooed, steam-dried and hung back by the crew that took them down.`,detail:`Curtains are the largest soft surface in most Gurgaon homes and almost never get cleaned. Dust from open windows, road grit from Sohna Road and Golf Course traffic, cooking smoke from the kitchen and pollen all settle into the pleats, where they stay until the fabric darkens, the colour fades unevenly and the room starts smelling of old cloth. A dusty curtain also holds the heat in summer and lets the dirt back through the moment the window is opened.

We take the panels down, vacuum both faces and the top pleat with an upholstery tool, then pre-treat the marks along the header and hem. Each panel is shampooed with a low-moisture extraction and hung in a steamed state so it dries stretched rather than creased. We rehang everything on your existing rods and tracks, adjust the drop, and check the hooks and gliders while we are up there. Rings and rods are wiped down at the same time.

The rate is ₹499 for a set of up to four panels, and a full home with three or four sets takes 3–4 hours depending on the window size and how high the rods are. The price moves with the fabric, since sheers and lightweight voile need a gentler treatment than blackout or velvet panels, with floor-length windows that need a ladder, and with the number of windows in the home, which is charged per set. Combining curtain cleaning with [carpet shampoo](/carpet-shampoo-cleaning-gurgaon.html) on the same visit is the cheapest way to do both.

We take curtain cleaning bookings across DLF Phase 2 and 3, Sector 43, 45 and 57, Golf Course Road, Sohna Road, MG Road, Palam Vihar, Sushant Lok 1 and the New Colony flats where high ceilings make the reach the deciding factor. Homes in the taller societies along Sohna Road usually book it before Diwali, when the dust of the last few months comes out of storage.`,image:`/images/sofa-shampoo-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Curtain panels removed from a Gurgaon living room window, vacuumed and shampooed before being rehung`,includes:[`Panels removed and rehung by us`,`Both-face vacuuming of fabric`,`Pleat, header and hem detailing`,`Stain pre-treatment on fabric`,`Low-moisture shampoo extraction`,`Steam drying to release creases`,`Rings, gliders and rod wipe-down`,`Drop and alignment adjusted`],process:[{step:1,title:`Survey`,desc:`We count the panels, check the fabric and note how the curtains are fixed.`},{step:2,title:`Remove`,desc:`Panels come down, hooks are bagged by type and each one is vacuumed.`},{step:3,title:`Shampoo`,desc:`Stains are pre-treated and the fabric is shampooed on a low-moisture pass.`},{step:4,title:`Rehang`,desc:`Dried panels go back on the rods with the drop adjusted level.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does curtain cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`₹499 covers a set of up to four panels, which is one window in a typical Gurgaon home. A three-window home is three sets, so about ₹1,500, and the exact quote is confirmed after we count the panels on the call. Longer or heavier fabric is charged per set rather than per panel, so a wide window does not cost double.`},{q:`How long does curtain cleaning take?`,a:`A single set takes about 30–40 minutes and a full home with three or four sets takes 3–4 hours, mostly because the panels have to dry before they are hung back. We use steam to set the fabric as it goes up, so the drop looks straight rather than creased from being folded in a bucket.`},{q:`Do you take the curtains down and put them back up?`,a:`Yes, removal and rehanging are included in the rate. We bag the hooks and rings separately by type so the same panel goes back to the same window, and we check the rods and tracks for bent gliders while we are there. If a curtain is fixed on a track that cannot be opened, we tell you on the call.`},{q:`Can you clean sheer or blackout curtains?`,a:`Yes. Sheers, voile and net curtains need a gentler, low-moisture treatment so the fabric does not stretch or shrink, while blackout and velvet panels take a stronger extraction. We check the care label first, and any curtain marked dry-clean-only is handled accordingly or skipped with your approval.`},{q:`Will the smell of smoke or damp go away?`,a:`Smoke and cooking odours lift well, because they sit on the surface of the fabric and the extraction pulls them out with the water. A damp or musty smell usually comes from the curtain staying wet for days in a humid balcony, and it may also point to a leaking window frame or a damp wall behind the curtain, which cleaning alone will not fix.`},{q:`How often should curtains be cleaned?`,a:`Every 6–8 months for a normal home, and every 3–4 months if the windows face a main road, if you cook a lot on the gas, or if the curtains stay near an open window through the dustier months. Homes near Golf Course Road and the Dwarka Expressway corridor collect noticeably more grit and benefit from the shorter cycle.`},{q:`Curtain cleaning ka kharcha aur time kya hai?`,a:`Curtain cleaning ₹499 per set hai, jisme chaar panels tak cover ho jaate hain. Ek set me 30–40 minutes lagte hain aur poore ghar me 3–4 ghante. Panels hum khud utaar ke wapas lagate hain.`},{q:`Can you clean blinds and drapes in the same visit?`,a:`Yes, vertical blinds and roller blinds are wiped and sanitised in the same visit, and they are priced separately from fabric curtains because they are cleaned in place. Drapes, which are heavier than curtains, follow the same extraction method at a slightly higher per-panel rate.`}],reviews:[],price:n.curtain},g={name:`Unfinished Basement & Godown Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Bare concrete, cleaned to the floor`,intro:`Unfinished basement and godown cleaning in Gurgaon clears construction dust, cement residue, oil stains and rodent debris from bare concrete floors, columns and drains, so the space is fit to store or rent out.`,detail:`An unfinished basement or godown in Gurgaon is raw concrete — no flooring, no paint, no finish — so every speck of dust and every drip of oil goes straight into the slab. After a construction project or a few years of storage, the floor is covered with cement dust and tyre marks, the columns carry paint splashes, and the corners hold bird debris, cobwebs and rodent droppings. Space like this cannot be shown to a tenant or used for storage until the slab and the drains are clean.

We work in three stages: dry sweeping and debris collection first, then a HEPA vacuum pass over the floor, walls and column surfaces, then a machine scrub with a degreaser for the oil and tyre marks that will not lift by vacuuming. Drain lines are cleared and flushed, droppings and organic debris are treated with a sanitising solution, and cobwebs in the ceiling corners come down last. Rubbish and construction debris are bagged and taken off the site.

The rate is ₹12 per sq ft for an unfinished basement or godown, and a 1,000 sq ft space takes 5–6 hours. The price moves with the debris volume we have to remove, the height of the columns and the number of bays, whether oil stains have soaked into the slab and need chemical treatment, and whether access is through a narrow staircase where the equipment has to be carried in by hand rather than wheeled.

We take basement and godown jobs in the industrial belt of IMT Manesar, Udyog Vihar Phase 1 to 5, Sohna Road, Sector 43, 45, 48 and 51, and in the residential basements of DLF Phase 3 and Palam Vihar where society owners want the storage and parking space usable again. The same crew and equipment handle both, so the price does not change with the type of space.`,image:`/images/office-deep-cleaning.jpg`,imageAlt:`Unfinished godown basement with bare concrete floor being machine scrubbed after heavy dust removal`,includes:[`Dry sweep and debris collection`,`HEPA vacuum of floor and walls`,`Machine scrub with degreaser`,`Oil and tyre stain treatment`,`Column and wall surface cleaning`,`Rodent and organic debris sanitising`,`Cobweb removal from ceiling corners`,`Drain line clearing and flushing`,`Bagged debris removed from site`],process:[{step:1,title:`Survey`,desc:`We measure the slab, check the access route and count the debris.`},{step:2,title:`Dry Clean`,desc:`The floor is swept, HEPA vacuumed and the organic debris treated first.`},{step:3,title:`Scrub`,desc:`The slab is machine-scrubbed, the stains treated and the drains fully flushed.`},{step:4,title:`Clear`,desc:`Bagged debris is removed and the space is left ready to use.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does basement or godown cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`₹12 per sq ft for an unfinished basement or godown, so a 1,000 sq ft space comes to ₹12,000. The price changes with the debris volume, the stain treatment needed on the slab and the access difficulty, because a narrow staircase means hand-carrying the machine in. We measure the area on site before the final quote.`},{q:`How long does a 1,000 sq ft godown take?`,a:`A 1,000 sq ft unfinished space takes 5–6 hours with a crew of three. Most of that time goes on the dry sweep and debris collection, because construction waste is heavier and wetter than ordinary dust. If the space has been used for storage with shelving and boxes in it, add an hour for moving and clearing those.`},{q:`Do you clean the drains and the water pooling?`,a:`Yes. Drain lines are cleared of debris and flushed, and the floor traps are cleaned so water does not sit and turn the slab into a mud pit. Standing water that comes from a leak in the slab is a plumbing problem — we clean what we find and tell you where the water is entering, but we do not repair the slab.`},{q:`Is rodent droppings safe to clean?`,a:`Not without precautions, which is why it is a separate step. The droppings are treated with a sanitising solution and left to work before any dry sweeping begins, so the dust is not thrown into the air and spread. Wear a mask and gloves if you enter the space before we arrive, and keep children and pets away from it in the meantime.`},{q:`Do you remove the rubble and construction debris?`,a:`Yes, loose debris and rubble are bagged and removed from the site as part of the job. We do not carry out structural demolition or remove fixed fixtures, and heavy chunks that need breaking are quoted separately. Tell us what is in the space when you book so we send the right crew and skipper capacity.`},{q:`Do you clean godowns used for storage and shops?`,a:`Yes. Godowns used for furniture storage, stock or machinery get the same slab, column and drain treatment. We work to suit the hours your godown is closed, mostly early morning or at night, so a shop that operates through the day does not lose trading time.`},{q:`Godown cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Unfinished basement aur godown cleaning ₹12 per sq ft hai, yaani 1,000 sq ft ke liye ₹12,000. Time lagta hai 5–6 ghante. Debris aur oil stains jitne zyada honge, cost bhi usi hisaab se badhta hai.`},{q:`Can you clean a basement inside a society tower?`,a:`Yes, we clean society basements and storage areas on a scheduled basis so the access gates, ramps and lifts stay usable. Sloped ramps and low-headroom sections are slower to machine-scrub, and we plan the crew and the order of the bays around the parking schedule so residents are not blocked.`}],reviews:[],price:n.basement},_={name:`Instant & Same-Day Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Booked in the morning, finished by evening`,intro:`Instant cleaning and same-day cleaning in Gurgaon sends a two to three person crew to your home within four hours of your call, for guest arrivals, post-party resets, pre-tenant showings and sudden visit prep.`,detail:`Same-day cleaning exists for the day the schedule cannot wait — a family arriving with guests in the evening, a flat that has to be shown to a tenant at four in the afternoon, a party that ended at two in the morning, or a home that simply has to be presentable by morning. The point is a fixed four-hour window from the moment the job is confirmed, not a vague promise of same-day service. You call before noon and the crew is on its way within the hour.

We map the flat on the call, decide with you what is in scope for the time available, and send a two to three person crew with a vacuum, a multi-surface mop, a microfibre kit and the bathroom and kitchen chemicals. Bathroom fixtures and the kitchen counter are cleaned first because they carry the most visible result, then bedrooms and living areas, then floors and touch points. The team works room by room and sends you a photo of each finished room before they leave.

The price is ₹999 for the same-day slot and the crew size is decided by the work, not by the clock. The price moves when the home has not been cleaned in a long time and the floors need scrubbing rather than mopping, when there are multiple bathrooms, or when the request is really a deep clean — in which case we quote the deep clean instead and let you choose the date. Nothing is added for the same-day slot itself.

Same-day slots run across DLF Phase 2 and 3, Sector 43, 45 and 57, Golf Course Road, Sohna Road, MG Road, Palam Vihar, Sushant Lok 1 and the New Colony apartments, and we cover the office belt in Cyber City and Udyog Vihar, where a client meeting at noon cannot wait. Book by phone early in the morning and the four-hour window holds. If you need more than a surface-level reset, the [full home deep clean](/deep-cleaning-services-in-gurgaon.html) is the better job.`,image:`/images/cleaning-1.webp`,imageAlt:`Two cleaners working quickly through a Gurgaon flat during a same-day cleaning visit with a vacuum and mop`,includes:[`Four-hour confirmed arrival window`,`Two to three person crew as standard`,`Bathroom fixtures cleaned first`,`Kitchen counter and sink wipe-down`,`Vacuuming of sofas, beds and mats`,`Wet-mopped floors throughout`,`Touch points and handles sanitised`,`Room-by-room photo updates`,`Walkthrough and sign-off before you pay`],process:[{step:1,title:`Call`,desc:`You call before noon and we map the home on the phone.`},{step:2,title:`Assign`,desc:`A crew of two or three is sent with the full kit.`},{step:3,title:`Clean`,desc:`The bathrooms, kitchen, bedrooms and floors are cleaned in that fixed order.`},{step:4,title:`Sign-Off`,desc:`You get room photos and a walkthrough before the payment is taken.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does same-day cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`₹999 for the same-day slot, and the crew size is set by the scope you confirm on the call. The four-hour window itself carries no extra charge. If the home needs real scrubbing rather than a reset, we price it as a deep clean instead, so you are not paying a same-day rate for a bigger job.`},{q:`How quickly can someone reach my home?`,a:`Call before noon and the crew reaches your home within four hours of confirmation, usually well inside that. The window is measured from the moment we lock the price and scope on the call, not from when you first picked up. Peak days around Diwali and the weekends in October run tighter, so an early call matters.`},{q:`What can be finished in four hours?`,a:`A 1 BHK or a 2 BHK can be reset properly inside four hours with two or three people, meaning bathrooms cleaned and descaled, the kitchen counter degreased, all rooms vacuumed and mopped, and touch points sanitised. A 3 BHK or a villa needs a full day rather than a four-hour window, and we will say so on the call.`},{q:`Do I need to be at home?`,a:`Not during the work. Many customers leave access instructions and go to work, and we send you a photo of each finished room from the site. Someone should be there for the final walkthrough, or you can approve by phone and settle the payment the same way.`},{q:`Is same-day cleaning the same as deep cleaning?`,a:`No. Same-day cleaning is a surface reset done fast — the right job for guests, showings and a home that has been kept reasonably well. A deep clean goes behind furniture, into grout, inside wardrobes and over every fixture, and that takes 5–6 hours for a 1 BHK and 7–8 hours for a 2 BHK. Book the deep clean for a proper reset.`},{q:`What if the home is in very bad condition?`,a:`Then a same-day crew cannot do it justice, and we will say so on the call rather than take the money and leave you with half the work. We will quote a deep clean with a date, or in some cases two same-day visits back to back, which gets a heavily neglected home to the same result faster than one rushed visit.`},{q:`Same-day cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Same-day cleaning ₹999 hai aur chaar ghante ke andar team pahunch jaati hai. Bathroom, kitchen, phir kamre aur floor — sab usi visit me. Doosri baar booking karne par charge wahi rehta hai, extra nahi lagta.`},{q:`Do you take instant cleaning bookings for offices?`,a:`Yes. A meeting room, a client floor or a showroom can be reset between bookings on the same day, and Cyber City and Udyog Vihar offices usually schedule it in the afternoon before an evening client. The same ₹999 slot applies, with the crew size adjusted to the number of cabins and washrooms involved.`}],reviews:[],price:n.instantclean},v={name:`Balcony Cleaning Services in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Wash off the dust your balcony collects`,intro:`Balcony cleaning services in Gurgaon pressure-wash dusty balcony floors, clear blocked drains and wipe glass, railings and grill, removing the monsoon dust, dried leaves and bird droppings every open balcony collects.`,detail:`A Gurgaon balcony is an outdoor room that nobody owns. It collects the dust from every storm in April and May, the dried leaves from the trees along Sohna Road, pigeon droppings from every railing, and cooking smoke if it sits next to the kitchen. The floor goes grey and slippery, the drain blocks, and the moss in the corners turns the wall green. It is the first place a guest is taken to show the view, and usually the dirtiest surface in the home.

We start with a dry sweep to lift the loose dust and leaf litter, then apply a degreaser where smoke or food residue has stuck to the tiles. The floor is pressure-washed with a foam lance so the grout lines come out clean, and the drain mouth is opened and the line flushed until the water runs free. Railings, grills and mesh are scrubbed, glass is wiped down, and the corners get the cobweb and moss treatment. Every balcony is left draining, not just looking clean.

The price is ₹399 per balcony and each one takes 45–60 minutes. The price moves with the size of the balcony and the depth of the blockage in the drain line, with floor-to-ceiling glass that has to be reached from inside the room, and with balconies on an upper floor where the water has to be carried up. Two or more balconies in one home are done in one visit with the same crew.

Balcony cleaning runs across DLF Phase 2 and 3, Sector 43, 45 and 57, Golf Course Road, Sohna Road, MG Road, Palam Vihar, Sushant Lok 1 and the New Colony towers where the balcony is the only open space in the flat. It also makes sense right before the rains, when the drains are still clear and the grout has not yet started growing moss. Pair it with a [full home deep clean](/deep-cleaning-services-in-gurgaon.html) if the balcony has never been cleaned.`,image:`/images/full-home-2bhk-deep-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Pressure washing a dusty Gurgaon balcony floor with a foam lance, drain cover and railing in view`,includes:[`Dry sweep of dust and leaf litter`,`Degreaser on smoke-marked tiles`,`Pressure wash of floor and grout`,`Drain opening and line flushing`,`Railings, grills and mesh scrubbed`,`Glass and windowsill wipe-down`,`Moss and mildew on corners`,`Cobweb removal from ceiling`,`Water-tested drainage at the end`],process:[{step:1,title:`Inspect`,desc:`We check the floor, the drain route and how the balcony is accessed.`},{step:2,title:`Sweep`,desc:`Loose dust, litter and cobwebs are removed before any water is used.`},{step:3,title:`Wash`,desc:`The floor is pressure-washed, and the glass and the railings are scrubbed.`},{step:4,title:`Flush`,desc:`The drains are cleared and flushed, and the whole balcony is water-tested.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does balcony cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`₹399 per balcony, with each balcony taking 45–60 minutes. Two or three balconies in one flat are cleaned in the same visit, so the setup cost is shared. The quote changes if the drain blockage runs deep into the line, if the balcony has floor-to-ceiling glass, or if it is on a floor without a working water connection nearby.`},{q:`Do you clear blocked balcony drains?`,a:`Yes, and it is part of the standard job. We open the drain mouth, remove the debris and flush the line until the water runs freely. If the blockage is further down the shared building line, we clear up to the point we can reach and tell you, because that part belongs to the building maintenance. A small repair at the mouth of the drain is arranged separately.`},{q:`Will the pressure wash damage my balcony tiles?`,a:`No. We start on the lowest pressure setting and increase only as the surface allows, and we test a hidden corner first. Vitrified and ceramic tiles handle it well, while wooden decking or painted surfaces are cleaned with a soft wash and low pressure, because high pressure lifts paint and roughens wood.`},{q:`How often should balconies be cleaned in Gurgaon?`,a:`Twice a year is enough for most homes, and once a year for those with a tree or a construction site close by. Do it before the monsoon, because that is when the drain is still clear and the grout has not yet started growing moss, and again in winter to take out the dust that has settled since April.`},{q:`Do you clean the balcony glass and railings too?`,a:`Yes. Glass, windowsills, railings, grills and mesh are all cleaned, and the grill is scrubbed where the grime has hardened around the joints. Floor-to-ceiling glass with an inward-opening panel needs the room side reached as well, which takes a few extra minutes. The glass is wiped with a squeegee so it does not streak.`},{q:`Can you clean a balcony with a washing machine or a drying rack on it?`,a:`Yes, we move them aside and clean underneath, then put them back where they were. A washing machine on a balcony is common in Gurgaon homes, and its own drum gets the same treatment. Tell us about it when you book so we allow the time for the machine to be shifted and the floor under it cleaned.`},{q:`Balcony cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Balcony cleaning ₹399 per balcony hai aur 45–60 minutes lagte hain. Floor pressure wash hota hai, drainage clear hoti hai aur railing, grill aur glass bhi saaf hote hain. Do balcony ek hi visit me ho jaati hain.`},{q:`Do you clean the service balcony and the society common balconies?`,a:`Yes, service balconies are charged the same as a private balcony. Society common balconies, podium gardens and terrace areas are quoted per area after a site visit, because the number of columns, planters and access points changes the time a lot. A terrace in a high-rise also needs a safety harness, which we arrange as part of the booking.`}],reviews:[],price:n.balconyclean},y={name:`Deep Cleaning Rate Per Square Foot in Gurgaon`,tagline:`One rate for the whole home, one bill`,intro:`Deep cleaning rate per square foot in Gurgaon is ₹3 per sq ft for a full-home deep clean. A 1 BHK measures about 450 sq ft, a 2 BHK about 850 sq ft and a 3 BHK about 1,250 sq ft — here is how the rate compares with the fixed BHK card.`,detail:`Most cleaning quotes in Gurgaon are priced per BHK, which is convenient until two flats with the same label turn out to be very different sizes. A "2 BHK" can be 600 sq ft or 1,000 sq ft, and the work is not the same in either. The per-square-foot rate removes that ambiguity: the price is the measured area multiplied by one rate, which does not move with your floor plan.

We measure on the walkthrough, room by room, and write the number on the quote before anything starts. Carpeted and tiled areas that we clean are counted, including under a fitted wardrobe and the utility floor if it is in scope, and the kitchen and bathroom tiles are included because they are the heaviest part of the job. Both are on the confirmation call, so the invoice matches what you agreed to.

At ₹3 per sq ft, a 1 BHK of about 450 sq ft comes to ₹1,350, a 2 BHK of about 850 sq ft to ₹2,550 and a 3 BHK of about 1,250 sq ft to ₹3,750. The fixed BHK card is ₹2,500 for a 1 BHK, ₹4,500 for a 2 BHK and ₹5,500 for a 3 BHK, and it bundles in work the sq-ft rate does not price — wardrobe interiors, the balcony, window tracks, ceiling fans and appliance interiors. The sq-ft rate is therefore cheaper on a compact home or a partial scope, while the card is worth it for a full reset in one line.

Both prices work the same way across DLF Phase 2 and 3, Sector 43, 45 and 57, Golf Course Road, Sohna Road, MG Road, Palam Vihar, Sushant Lok 1 and the New Colony blocks — we carry the measuring tape, not a label. Send us the carpet area from your brochure and we will tell you which price applies to your flat, and you can compare it with our [full home deep cleaning](/deep-cleaning-services-in-gurgaon.html) scope before you decide.`,image:`/images/full-home-deep-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Gurgaon home deep cleaning crew measuring the floor area of a room before confirming the cleaning quote`,includes:[`Room-by-room measured on site`,`Written area and rate on the quote`,`One rate, no size surprises`,`Core deep clean across all rooms`,`Kitchen and bathroom tiles included`,`Utility and balcony floors in scope`,`Wardrobe interiors bundled on the card`,`Window tracks and ceiling fans`,`Invoice matches the agreed number`],process:[{step:1,title:`Measure`,desc:`We measure every room in scope and note the total usable area.`},{step:2,title:`Compare`,desc:`You see the sq-ft total and the BHK card side by side on the quote.`},{step:3,title:`Clean`,desc:`The agreed scope is cleaned room by room with our standard checklist.`},{step:4,title:`Reconcile`,desc:`The final invoice matches the area written down on the confirmation call.`}],faqs:[{q:`What is the deep cleaning rate per square foot in Gurgaon?`,a:`₹3 per sq ft for the standard full-home deep clean scope. A 1 BHK of about 450 sq ft is ₹1,350, a 2 BHK of about 850 sq ft is ₹2,550 and a 3 BHK of about 1,250 sq ft is ₹3,750. The area is measured on the walkthrough and both the measurement and the rate go on the quote before the work starts.`},{q:`Is per square foot cheaper than the BHK price card?`,a:`For most flats, yes, because you pay only for the area actually cleaned. The BHK card is ₹2,500 for a 1 BHK, ₹4,500 for a 2 BHK and ₹5,500 for a 3 BHK, and it bundles in wardrobe interiors, balcony, window tracks, fans and appliance interiors. The sq-ft rate suits a compact home or a partial scope; the card suits a full reset.`},{q:`How do you measure the area?`,a:`We use the usable floor area of every room in scope, measured on the walkthrough with a tape measure, not the carpet area printed in a brochure. Areas under fitted wardrobes and utility floors are included when they are cleaned, and the total is written on the quote along with the rate. You get the room-by-room breakdown before the job starts.`},{q:`How long does a per-sq-ft deep clean take?`,a:`A 1 BHK takes 5–6 hours, a 2 BHK 7–8 hours and a 3 BHK 9–10 hours, with a villa at 10–12 hours. The area decides the hours, but so does the condition, so we add time for a heavily soiled kitchen or bathroom. A larger crew shortens the visit without changing the price, because the rate is on the area.`},{q:`Does the rate include the kitchen and bathroom?`,a:`Yes, the kitchen and bathroom tiles are part of the measured area, and they are cleaned to the same standard as the rest of the home: grout scrubbed, taps descaled and fittings sanitised. Appliance interiors and chimney filter cleaning are separate lines unless you take the BHK card, which bundles them in.`},{q:`Is the price fixed before you start?`,a:`Yes. The measured area, the rate and the total are all on the confirmation call, and the invoice at the end matches that number. If the measured area changes on the day, we do not quietly adjust it — we tell you before the work starts and you decide whether to proceed. Payment is after the walkthrough, not before.`},{q:`Sq ft ke hisaab se cleaning ka rate kya hai?`,a:`Full home deep cleaning ₹3 per sq ft hai. 1 BHK lagbhag 450 sq ft, 2 BHK 850 sq ft aur 3 BHK 1,250 sq ft hota hai. Measurement walkthrough ke time hoti hai aur total pehle se confirm kar diya jata hai.`},{q:`Do you charge extra for difficult access?`,a:`The rate covers a home in normal condition. It changes if the property has not been cleaned for a long time and needs heavy scrubbing, if there are more than two floors without a working lift, or if you add areas that were not in the original scope, such as a terrace. Each addition is quoted as a line before we start, never on the invoice.`}],reviews:[],price:n.sqftrate},b={name:`Kitchen Platform Deep Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`The grease under the platform, gone`,intro:`Kitchen platform deep cleaning in Gurgaon lifts burnt oil, food splatter and sticky residue from the platform edge, cabinet doors, backsplash tiles and the sink base, which is where kitchen grime actually collects.`,detail:`In an Indian kitchen the grease does not stay on the counter, it moves. Oil vapour from the stove settles on the underside of the wall cabinets and the back of the platform, then runs down the joint where the counter meets the tile and sets there as a hard black layer. That layer harbours cockroach eggs and smells even when the counter looks wiped. Nobody cleans under the platform edge, which is why the kitchen smells the same after every quick wipe.

We clear the platform, bag the loose items and cover the gas and electricals first. An alkaline degreaser is applied and left to dwell, then the platform top, the edge profile and the joint behind it are scrubbed with a slim brush. The cabinet doors and drawer fronts come off for cleaning, the sink base is pulled out so the underside, pipe joints and wall behind it can be degreased, and the backsplash tiles are scrubbed. Handles and touch points are sanitised at the end.

The rate is ₹999 and the job takes 2–3 hours, covering the platform, the cabinets, the backsplash and the sink base. The price moves with the platform material, since granite and quartz need a different cream and a lighter scrub than a tiled or mosaic platform, with heavy carbon build-up that needs a second dwell, and with a plumbed sink base, which takes longer to pull out and reseal than a modular one.

Kitchen platform deep cleaning runs across DLF Phase 2 and 3, Sector 43, 45 and 57, Golf Course Road, Sohna Road, MG Road, Palam Vihar, Sushant Lok 1, the New Colony flats and the society clubhouses. Modular kitchens in DLF Phase 4 and 5 high-rises take longer because the panels are veneer and the edges are sealed. Ask for it together with our [kitchen deep cleaning](/kitchen-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html) and the hob, chimney and interiors are done in the same visit.`,image:`/images/kitchen-deep-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Degreasing the joint behind a kitchen platform and cabinet fronts with a slim brush during a deep clean`,includes:[`Platform top, edge and back joint`,`Under-cabinet grease and vapour film`,`Cabinet doors and drawer fronts removed`,`Sink base underside and pipe joints`,`Backsplash tile degreasing`,`Baked-on carbon on hob surround`,`Touch points and handle sanitising`,`Items cleared and replaced after`,`Gas and electricals covered first`],process:[{step:1,title:`Clear`,desc:`The platform is emptied and the gas and the electricals are covered first.`},{step:2,title:`Degrease`,desc:`Alkaline solution is applied and left to work on the grease film.`},{step:3,title:`Scrub`,desc:`The platform, cabinets, backsplash and the sink base are scrubbed by hand.`},{step:4,title:`Reset`,desc:`Everything is rinsed, sanitised, reassembled and put back where it was before.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does kitchen platform deep cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`₹999 covers the platform, the cabinet fronts, the backsplash tiles and the sink base, and the job takes 2–3 hours. The price changes if the platform is granite or quartz and needs a lighter abrasive, if the black carbon layer is heavy enough for a second dwell, or if the sink base is plumbed under a counter and has to be pulled out and resealed.`},{q:`How long does it take?`,a:`2–3 hours for a standard Indian kitchen, including the drying time for the platform edge. A kitchen that has never been deep cleaned and has a thick grease layer takes closer to the upper end of that. The chimney and hob are not included by default — add them on the call if they need the same treatment.`},{q:`Is the grease under the platform really the problem?`,a:`In most kitchens, yes. Oil vapour from the stove condenses on the underside of the wall cabinets and on the back wall, then runs down behind the platform and sets into a black layer that a wipe does not touch. That layer is also what keeps the kitchen smelling even after the floor and counter are cleaned, so it is the part worth doing properly.`},{q:`Do you move my appliances and vessels?`,a:`The vessels and small items are cleared from the platform, bagged and set aside, then returned to the same place at the end. The gas cylinder and the hob stay in place because the gas is covered and disconnected for the work, and it is reconnected and tested before we leave. Anything you have told us is fragile is handled by the crew and put back first.`},{q:`Will you scratch a granite platform?`,a:`No. Granite and quartz are cleaned with a pH-balanced cream and a non-abrasive pad, never with acid, because acid dulls the polish and etches the surface over time. Marble is the one exception — it needs a neutral pH only and we tell you on the call if your platform is marble. The edges and joint get a slim brush, not a wire one.`},{q:`Can cockroaches be behind the platform?`,a:`Often, yes, and that is why the joint behind the platform is cleaned rather than skipped. We degrease the back wall and the joint, which removes the food residue the insects feed on, and sanitise the surface. If you see live activity or a nest, we will tell you, because that needs a pest treatment alongside the cleaning, not just a deeper wipe.`},{q:`Kitchen platform cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Kitchen platform deep cleaning ₹999 hai aur 2–3 ghante lagte hain. Platform ka edge, cabinets ka front, backsplash ki tiles aur sink base — sab ek hi visit me saaf hote hain. Chimney aur hob alag se add karwa sakte hain.`},{q:`Do you clean modular and wooden kitchens the same way?`,a:`The method is the same, but the products differ. Veneer and laminate panels are cleaned with a mild degreaser and wiped dry, because water sitting on a seam can lift the edge. A tiled or mosaic platform takes a stronger alkaline treatment. We check the material on the call, which is also how we tell you whether the ₹999 rate holds or needs adjusting.`}],reviews:[],price:n.kitchenplatform},x={name:`Post-Construction Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Three passes to clear every speck of dust`,intro:`Post-construction cleaning in Gurgaon removes cement dust, paint drips and adhesive residue from a newly built or freshly renovated home in three phases: rough debris, high surfaces, then a final fine dust and polish pass.`,detail:`Construction dust is not ordinary dust. The fine cement particles produced by cutting, drilling and grinding get into grout lines, socket cavities, false ceiling voids, AC grills and every unfinished edge, and they settle again every time the wind moves through a half-open window. A normal mop walks the dust into a film and spreads it. Paint drips on tiles, silicone smears on glass and adhesive residue on the floor need solvents and hand work, so the job has to be done in the right order or the dust simply returns.

We work in three phases. Phase one is the rough stage: rubble, packaging, plaster chips and excess material cleared and removed from the site. Phase two is the high stage, where false ceilings, AC vents, fan blades, ledges, window frames, wall tops and the tops of doors are cleaned with a vacuum and a long-reach tool. Phase three is the final stage: a HEPA fine dust pass over every surface, a scrub of the tiles and grout, glass and frame polish, and the removal of paint marks and adhesive with the right solvent for each material.

The price is ₹2,499 for a 1 BHK up to 600 sq ft, and the work takes 1–2 days depending on the site. The price moves with the number of floors and whether there is working lift access, with paint drips and adhesive that need solvents rather than wiping, with the number of fixtures and whether the kitchen and bathrooms were fitted, and with debris volume in phase one. Debris removal beyond the loose waste is charged separately.

Post-construction cleaning runs in the new societies along Sohna Road, Sector 43, 45, 48, 51 and 57, the DLF Phase 5 and DLF City Phase 4 handover blocks, Golf Course Extension, New Gurgaon and the residential projects in Manesar. We also handle renovation work inside an occupied flat, where the same three phases are applied room by room so the household can stay in the home. Book it before the furniture arrives.`,image:`/images/full-home-3bhk-deep-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Post-construction cleaning crew vacuuming fine cement dust from a false ceiling ledge in a new Gurgaon flat`,includes:[`Phase one rubble and debris removal`,`False ceiling and AC vent cleaning`,`Fan blades, ledges and window frames`,`HEPA fine dust pass on all surfaces`,`Tile and grout scrub after sanding`,`Glass and frame polish`,`Paint drip and adhesive removal`,`Touch points and switchboard sanitising`,`Debris hauled from the site`],process:[{step:1,title:`Survey`,desc:`We walk the site, measure it and note the paint and adhesive marks.`},{step:2,title:`Rough Phase`,desc:`All the rubble and the packaging are cleared and removed from the site.`},{step:3,title:`High Phase`,desc:`The ceilings, vents, ledges, frames and the fan blades are all cleaned.`},{step:4,title:`Fine Phase`,desc:`HEPA dusting, grout scrub, glass polish and a final walkthrough with you.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does post-construction cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`₹2,499 for a 1 BHK up to 600 sq ft, and the work takes 1–2 days depending on the site. The price moves with the number of floors and lift access, with paint drips and adhesive that need solvents, and with how many fixtures were installed. Heavy rubble removal in phase one is quoted separately, because it needs a skipper and extra crew.`},{q:`How long does post-construction cleaning take?`,a:`One to two days for a 1 BHK, because the three phases cannot be compressed into one visit without the dust returning. Phase one is the rough removal, phase two covers the high surfaces and phase three is the fine HEPA pass with the grout scrub. A 2 BHK or 3 BHK usually needs the second day mostly for phase three.`},{q:`Why is it done in three phases?`,a:`Because the dust settles in a predictable order. If the fine pass happens before the rubble is moved, the debris coats every clean surface again and you have paid for the same work twice. Clearing first, then cleaning high, then fine-dusting means each phase removes what the previous one exposed. The sequence is the reason the result holds.`},{q:`Do you remove paint and adhesive marks?`,a:`Yes, with a solvent matched to the material — tile, glass, wood or metal. Some marks lift straight away; silicone on glass and adhesive on a floor take longer and may need a second pass, and we tell you which marks are realistic before we start. Marks that have soaked into the tile grout or the paint itself cannot be removed without resurfacing, and we are honest about that.`},{q:`Do you clean the false ceiling and the AC ducts?`,a:`The false ceiling panels, grilles, vent covers and fan blades are all cleaned, which is where most of the trapped dust sits. We do not open the sealed cavity of an AC duct or a concealed false ceiling, because that is a technical job. If a duct has a service access and the AC technician is due, cleaning it at the same time is the cheapest moment to do it.`},{q:`Do you remove the construction waste?`,a:`Loose rubble, packaging, plaster chips and debris are cleared and hauled away in phase one as part of the job. Structural demolition, removing fixed fixtures and disposing of large volumes of waste need a separate quote, because they need a skipper and more crew. Tell us what is on site when you book.`},{q:`Construction ke baad cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Post-construction cleaning ₹2,499 se hoti hai, 1 BHK ke liye jo 600 sq ft tak ho. Time lagta hai 1–2 din, kyunki kaam teen phase me hota hai — debris, high surfaces aur final HEPA dust. Payment walkthrough ke baad hota hai.`},{q:`Can you clean a flat that is already occupied?`,a:`Yes, and most of our renovation work is inside occupied homes. We run the three phases room by room, one room at a time, so the family can keep using the rest of the flat, and we sheet the furniture that cannot be moved. Full-home deep cleaning can be combined with it if you want the whole property reset at the same time.`}],reviews:[],price:n.postconstruction},S={name:`Single Room Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`One room, done properly, in an hour`,intro:`Single room cleaning in Gurgaon covers one bedroom, one kitchenette or one bathroom for ₹299, taking 60–90 minutes with a written checklist for that room and a trained cleaner who works to it.`,detail:`Most homes do not need a full deep clean every month. What they usually need is one room that has got away from them — the bedroom where the clothes pile up, the kitchenette a tenant uses, the bathroom with hard-water marks. Booking a full-home deep clean for that is overkill, and skipping it altogether lets the room set the tone of the whole flat. Single room cleaning is the small, precise version of the same work.

The cleaner starts with the room and a checklist written for that specific room type: vacuum the floor, the bed base or cot, under the furniture, the curtains and the cushions, then dust the walls, the window frames, the ledges and the electronics, then wet-wipe every surface that should not be sprayed. A bathroom room also gets the taps descaled, the mirror and glass wiped, the floor scrubbed and the fittings sanitised. A kitchenette room gets the counter degreased, the sink scrubbed and the bins emptied.

The price is ₹299 per room and the visit takes 60–90 minutes. The price does not change with the room type, but the time does, because a bathroom or a kitchenette is slower than a bedroom. The price changes if the room has not been touched in a long time, if there are stains that need extra dwell, or if you add a mattress shampoo, a window glass clean, a curtain clean or a wall spot clean. Two or more rooms booked together are cleaned in one visit.

Single room bookings run across DLF Phase 2 and 3, Sector 43, 45 and 57, Golf Course Road, Sohna Road, MG Road, Palam Vihar, Sushant Lok 1 and the New Colony flats, and we do hostel and PG rooms in these areas on a monthly plan. If the room needs more than a reset, we will tell you on the call and quote a [deep clean](/deep-cleaning-services-in-gurgaon.html) instead, so you are not paying twice for the same job.`,image:`/images/house-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Single bedroom being cleaned in a Gurgaon flat, vacuum cleaner running along the skirting and under the bed`,includes:[`Room-specific written checklist`,`Vacuum under bed, cot and furniture`,`Curtains, cushions and upholstery dusted`,`Walls, ledges and window frames`,`Hard-water taps and tiles descaled`,`Kitchenette counter and sink degreased`,`Bins emptied and surfaces sanitised`,`Walkthrough and sign-off before payment`],process:[{step:1,title:`Scope`,desc:`We agree on the room type and what is included on the call.`},{step:2,title:`Checklist`,desc:`A written checklist for that room is used so nothing gets skipped.`},{step:3,title:`Clean`,desc:`The room is vacuumed, dusted, wet-wiped, scrubbed and sanitised in that order.`},{step:4,title:`Check`,desc:`The room is walked through with you before the payment is taken.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does single room cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`₹299 per room, whether it is a bedroom, a kitchenette or a bathroom, and the visit takes 60–90 minutes. Two or more rooms booked together are cleaned in the same visit, so the cost per room comes down. Add-ons such as a mattress shampoo, a window glass clean or a curtain clean are priced separately and quoted on the call.`},{q:`What is included in a single room clean?`,a:`A written checklist for that room type: vacuuming of the floor, under the bed or cot, the curtains, cushions and under the furniture, dusting of walls, ledges and window frames, wet-wiping of surfaces, mopping, sanitising of touch points and emptying the bin. A bathroom adds tap descaling and a floor scrub, and a kitchenette adds counter degreasing and sink scrubbing.`},{q:`How long does one room take?`,a:`60–90 minutes for a bedroom. A bathroom or a kitchenette takes closer to 90 minutes because of the scrubbing, descaling and degreasing involved. A room that has not been cleaned in months takes longer as well, since the dust has to come off in layers. If you book several rooms, each one is done after the other on the same visit.`},{q:`Do you move my furniture?`,a:`Yes, light furniture such as chairs, side tables and bins are shifted so the floor and skirting can be cleaned properly, then put back exactly where they were. Beds, almirahs and heavy pieces are cleaned around, and if you want the space under a bed done, tell us on the call so we plan the time for it.`},{q:`Can I book it every week or every month?`,a:`Yes, and it works out cheaper per visit than a one-off. Recurring bookings for a single room are common for hostels, PG rooms and for anyone who wants one room kept in order while the rest of the flat is handled differently. The same cleaner is assigned where possible, so they learn the room and work faster each time.`},{q:`Is it the same as deep cleaning?`,a:`Not quite. A single room clean is a thorough reset of one room — the kind of job that takes 60–90 minutes. A deep clean of the same room goes further: inside the wardrobes, under the bed, into the window tracks, over the fan and the switchboards, with the grout scrubbed. If the room needs that level of work, we quote a deep clean instead.`},{q:`Ek room ki cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Single room cleaning ₹299 hai, chahe bedroom ho, kitchenette ho ya bathroom. Time 60–90 minutes lagta hai. Do ya zyada rooms ek saath book karne se per-room cost kam ho jaati hai.`},{q:`Do you clean PG and hostel rooms?`,a:`Yes, in the PG clusters around Sector 43, 45 and 57 and near MG Road, we do recurring room cleaning for per-floor plans. The room checklist is the same, and the rooms are done one after another on a fixed weekly or monthly schedule. Move-out rooms get the empty-room version of the same job.`}],reviews:[],price:n.roomclean},C={deep:{name:`Deep Cleaning Services in Gurgaon`,tagline:`A top-to-bottom refresh for every corner of your home.`,intro:`What is deep cleaning? A true deep cleaning reaches what regular cleaning misses — and our deep cleaning services in Gurgaon deliver it with machines. Searching deep cleaning services near me or deep cleaners near me lands you on the same verified team.`,detail:`[Regular sweeping and mopping](/house-cleaning-services-in-gurgaon.html) only reaches the surface. A genuine deep cleaning reaches everything else: grease-laden kitchen tiles, hard-water marks in bathrooms, dust hidden on ceiling fans, inside wardrobes, behind beds and under sofas. Gurgaon’s dusty, construction-heavy environment means fine particulate settles into carpets, mattresses and upholstery — which is exactly where dust mites and allergens thrive. That is what deep cleaning means: every surface, including hidden ones, in one intensive visit.

Our trained deep cleaners near you work top-to-bottom and room-by-room with professional machines and eco-friendly products. Whether you book deep cleaning services near me for a 1 BHK or a [villa](/full-home-deep-cleaning-4bhk-gurgaon.html), we shift light furniture, detail every fixture, wash windows and sanitize high-touch surfaces like switches and door handles. The result is a home that not only looks cleaner but actually breathes easier. Most Gurgaon families book a full deep clean every 3–6 months, and before or after the festive season, [moving in or out](/move-in-move-out-cleaning-gurgaon.html), or post-renovation.

Gurgaon’s hard water leaves calcium and magnesium deposits on taps, shower heads and tile grout that normal wiping cannot remove — our descaling treatment handles this properly. Construction dust from Dwarka Expressway, Golf Course Extension and Sohna Road corridors embeds in sofa fibres, AC filters and chimney interiors even in well-sealed homes.

Pre-Diwali (Oct–Nov) and post-monsoon are the busiest periods — we recommend booking early for those slots. Our deep cleaning services also cover move-in / move-out empty-flat resets and post-construction removal of cement dust, paint drips and adhesive residue, plus cluster-day [society bookings for towers and RWAs](/society-cleaning-services-gurgaon.html), all at the same verified-team, pay-after-satisfaction standard.

Price honesty, with figures you can check: Urban Company lists 2 BHK home deep cleaning from roughly ₹4,500 upward before the platform layer; NoBroker’s furnished-apartment premium tier sits near ₹3,759 for narrower scope; Safaiwale’s public rate card puts a 2 BHK at ₹5,000. Our 2 BHK deep cleaning services Gurgaon package is a fixed ₹4,500 — machines, products, travel and walkthrough included, [locked on the call](/contact.html). Same city, same machines, no commission layer, no asterisk. Prices checked against public listings, September 2026 — re-check any provider before booking.

Method, not muscle: single-disc machine scrubbing for tile and vitrified floors, hot-water extraction for sofas and carpets, steam sanitization for kitchens and bathrooms, timed acid descaling for Gurgaon’s hard water, and pro-grade eco-safe chemistry throughout. Honest boundary, stated upfront: utensils, wall repainting, marble diamond polish, sealed appliance motors and rope-access facades sit outside deep cleaning everywhere — anyone bundling them into a headline price is hiding the real bill.`,image:`/images/full-home-deep-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Deep cleaning services in Gurgaon — trained team scrubbing floors, tiles and furniture top to bottom`,includes:[`Floor & tile scrubbing and polishing`,`Wall, ceiling and fixture dusting`,`Furniture, wardrobe and cupboard detailing`,`Kitchen degreasing — countertops, stove, chimney, cabinets`,`Bathroom descaling — tiles, faucets, commode, grout`,`Windows, sills and glass cleaning`,`Anti-viral sanitization of touch points`,`Cobweb removal and under-furniture vacuuming`,`Balcony & utility deep clean — scrub, railing, drains`,`Appliance exterior detailing — fridge, microwave, oven faces`,`Skirting & behind-furniture zones — edge lanes, under-bed, sides`,`Final walkthrough sign-off — ticked room sheets before payment`],process:[{step:1,title:`Walkthrough & Quote`,desc:`We assess your home, note problem areas and lock the exact price on the confirmation call.`},{step:2,title:`Deep Clean`,desc:`Every room is degreased, descrubbed and detailed top-to-bottom.`},{step:3,title:`Sanitize`,desc:`Switches, handles and touch points are disinfected.`},{step:4,title:`Final Check`,desc:`We walk through every room with you for sign-off.`}],faqs:[{q:`How long does deep cleaning take?`,a:`Typically 4–10 hours depending on home size — a 1 BHK takes 5–6 hours, a 2 BHK 7–8 hours, and a 3 BHK about 9–10 hours with a larger team.`},{q:`How often should a home be deep cleaned in Gurgaon?`,a:`Because of dust and construction activity, most Gurgaon homes benefit from a deep clean every 3–6 months. After that, regular house cleaning keeps it maintained.`},{q:`Do you bring your own equipment?`,a:`Yes — professional machines, eco-friendly products and all tools are included in the price. You do not need to arrange anything.`},{q:`Do you move furniture?`,a:`Light furniture is shifted to clean behind and under it. Heavy items like wardrobes can be moved on request, and we place everything back exactly as it was.`},{q:`What is the difference between regular and deep cleaning?`,a:`Regular cleaning dusts and mops visible surfaces. Deep cleaning scrubs grout, descales taps, degreases kitchens, shampoos sofas and cleans areas that daily cleaning cannot reach.`},{q:`Is deep cleaning safe for kids and pets?`,a:`Yes — we use non-toxic, eco-friendly cleaning solutions that are safe for children, elderly and pets, with no harsh chemical residue.`},{q:`How much does deep cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Deep cleaning in Gurgaon starts from ₹2,000 for a 1 RK or studio and goes up to ₹9,000 for a 5 BHK. The exact price depends on your home size, number of bathrooms and condition.`},{q:`What areas do you serve in Gurgaon?`,a:`We serve all sectors in Gurgaon — DLF Phase 1–5, Sohna Road, Golf Course Road, MG Road, Palam Vihar, Sushant Lok, South City, Golf Course Extension and all residential societies across Gurugram.`},{q:`Do I need to be present during the deep cleaning?`,a:`You should be present at the start for a walkthrough and at the end for sign-off. Many customers step out during the clean itself — we are happy to work with access instructions and share a progress update.`},{q:`What if I am not satisfied with the cleaning?`,a:`You only pay after you have walked through and approved the work. If any area is missed or unsatisfactory, we re-clean it on the spot before you pay.`},{q:`Gurgaon me deep cleaning kitne din me karwani chahiye?`,a:`Gurgaon ki dhool aur construction ki wajah se har 3–6 mahine me ek baar deep cleaning karwana behtar hai. Diwali se pehle ya baad me karwana sabse common hai.`},{q:`Deep cleaning me kya kya saaf hota hai?`,a:`Kitchen, bathroom, sofa, wardrobes, windows, grout, chimney aur high-touch surfaces tak saaf kiya jata hai — jo roz ke safai me nahi hota.`},{q:`What is the price of deep cleaning services in Gurgaon?`,a:`From ₹2,000 (1 RK) to ₹9,000 (5 BHK villa). The sweet spot: 1 BHK ₹2,500, 2 BHK ₹4,500, 3 BHK ₹5,500 — fixed on call, machines and products included. JustDial’s published market range (₹2,000–₹10,000) sits exactly around our card.`},{q:`What are the best deep cleaning services in Gurgaon?`,a:`Shortlist by proof, not ads: police verification shown on request, itemised written scope, fixed price before arrival, pay-after walkthrough, and sector-tagged reviews. Whether you compare deep cleaning services Gurgaon providers on price, scope or reviews, the test is the same five proofs — verification, written scope, locked price, pay-after terms and sector-tagged reviews.`},{q:`What is usually included in a deep clean?`,a:`Floors scrubbed, walls/ceiling dusted, furniture and wardrobes detailed, kitchen degreased (chimney dismantled), bathrooms descaled (grout, commode, glass), windows and balconies, sofa vacuumed, touch points sanitised — ending in a ticked walkthrough. Excluded everywhere: utensils, repainting, marble polish, sealed motors.`},{q:`How much does 24-hour maid service cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Full-time live-in maids via agencies run roughly ₹12,000–₹18,000/month plus agency fee — and maids cannot descale, degrease chimneys or extract sofas. Most families pair part-time help for daily chores with our quarterly deep reset (₹4,500/2 BHK) instead.`},{q:`Urban Company vs local deep cleaning in Gurgaon?`,a:`Urban Company offers app-scale consistency (4.79, 853K+ reviews on its Gurgaon deep-cleaning page) with platform pricing from ~₹3,499–₹4,500+. Local verified teams like ours run the same machines at fixed BHK rates (2 BHK ₹4,500) with direct owner accountability and pay-after terms. Compare identical scopes line-by-line, not logos.`},{q:`Do you handle small single tasks (fan, fridge, windows)?`,a:`Yes — fan cleaning, fridge interiors (₹500 add-on), window detailing and similar mini-tasks book as add-ons to any visit or as room-rate jobs. NoBroker-style mini-menus exist because small jobs are real; we price ours on the same call.`},{q:`What protects me if something is damaged?`,a:`Three layers: trained, background-checked crew with a supervisor on every job; careful protection (corner guards, electronics-safe methods near devices); and our re-clean-or-make-right promise — any miss flagged at walkthrough is fixed on the spot before you pay a rupee.`},{q:`How much is a 1 hour clean in Gurgaon?`,a:`We do not sell 1-hour cleans — an hour covers a surface wipe, not deep cleaning, and hourly billing rewards slow work. Honest equivalents: single-room details (₹800–₹1,500), mini-tasks absorbed into any visit, or a house-cleaning visit from ₹499. Fixed scope beats open-ended hours every time.`}],reviews:[[`SR`,`Sunita Rao`,`DLF Phase 2`,`Booked a full home deep clean before Diwali. The team scrubbed grout I'd given up on and the kitchen looked brand new. Worth every rupee.`],[`AD`,`Arjun Desai`,`Sector 57`,`They found and cleaned things I never even noticed — behind the fridge, under the beds, inside the wardrobes. Genuinely top-to-bottom.`],[`MK`,`Meera Kapoor`,`Golf Course Road`,`Pay-after-cleaning gave me full confidence. The house smelled fresh and the team was respectful and on time. Highly recommend.`]],price:n.deep,priceCheck:{title:`Gurgaon 2 BHK Price Check — Us vs Public Listings`,note:`Public listing figures, September 2026. Scopes differ — compare line items, not headlines. Re-check any provider before booking.`,head:[`Provider`,`2 BHK Signal`,`Terms`],rows:[[`Urban Company`,`~₹4,500+ (page starts ₹3,499)`,`Platform pricing, app booking`],[`NoBroker`,`₹3,200–₹4,600 (tiered packs)`,`Rescheduling included`],[`Safaiwale`,`₹5,000 (rate card)`,`Sq-ft based card`],[`ZoopGo bands`,`₹3,800–₹5,500`,`Aggregator bidding range`],[`Sachin Deep Cleaning`,`₹4,500 fixed`,`Locked on call, pay after walkthrough`]]},pricingTable:[{service:`Full home deep cleaning — 1 BHK`,price:`From ₹2,500`},{service:`Full home deep cleaning — 2 BHK`,price:`From ₹4,500`},{service:`Full home deep cleaning — 3 BHK`,price:`From ₹5,500`},{service:`Full home deep cleaning — 4 BHK`,price:`From ₹6,500`},{service:`Full home deep cleaning — 5 BHK`,price:`From ₹9,000`},{service:`Kitchen deep cleaning`,price:`From ₹1,500`},{service:`Bathroom deep cleaning`,price:`From ₹800`},{service:`Sofa shampoo cleaning`,price:`From ₹499 / seat`},{service:`Carpet shampoo cleaning`,price:`From ₹18 / sq ft`},{service:`House cleaning (regular)`,price:`From ₹499 / visit`},{service:`Office deep cleaning`,price:`From ₹5,000`},{service:`Move-in / move-out cleaning`,price:`From ₹1,999`}]},house:{name:`House Cleaning Services in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Reliable, affordable cleaning for a healthier home.`,intro:`Our house cleaning services Gurgaon plans — also booked as home cleaning services — keep your Gurgaon home consistently spotless, with [home cleaning services near me](/residential-cleaners-near-me.html) slots same-day. Booked as a single house cleaning service in Gurgaon, each visit follows a written room-by-room checklist at a fixed per-visit price.`,detail:`Life in Gurgaon leaves little time for keeping up with dusting, mopping and tidying — and that is exactly what our house cleaning service is built for. Whether you search home cleaning services, home cleaning services near me or house cleaning services Gurgaon, you land on the same verified team. With construction dust from Dwarka Expressway, Golf Course Extension and [Sohna Road](/blog/sohna-road-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html) constantly settling, homes need regular maintenance just to stay comfortable. We offer one-time cleans for a fresh start, plus weekly and bi-weekly home cleaning services plans so your home stays consistently clean without you lifting a finger.

Each home cleaning services near me visit includes full dusting and vacuuming, mopping and floor care, kitchen and bathroom surface upkeep, bin emptying and liner change, and sanitization of high-touch surfaces. We work around your schedule in [DLF Phase 1–5](/blog/dlf-phase-1-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html), Sushant Lok, South City, Palam Vihar, MG Road, Sector 45/46/57 and all Huda sectors. The checklist is tailored to your home size — from compact studio apartments and 1 BHK flats to 3–4 BHK villas.

Gurgaon’s hard water and cooking-heavy kitchens mean surface film builds up fast. Regular house cleaning prevents that buildup from becoming a deep-clean problem. Prices start at ₹499 per visit for a studio and scale by size. Every cleaner is police-verified, brings eco-friendly supplies, and you pay only after you walk through and approve the work. Weekly plans get the same trusted team each visit, so they learn your preferences and clean faster over time.

A house cleaning service in Gurgaon is defined by what it is not: not [a maid placement](/blog/house-maid-vs-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html), not [a one-time deep clean](/deep-cleaning-services-in-gurgaon.html), but a scheduled upkeep visit by a verified two-person team carrying its own HEPA vacuum, microfiber kit, multi-surface mop and eco-friendly sprays — you provide only water and power. Each visit follows the same written checklist, so quality does not depend on who shows up.

Visit scope scales honestly by home size. A studio or 1 RK (₹499, about an hour) covers the single room, kitchenette, bathroom and entrance. A 1 BHK (₹799, 1.5–2 hours) adds the bedroom wardrobe exteriors, living-area detailing and balcony sweep. A 2 BHK (₹1,199, 2–3 hours) doubles bathroom upkeep, adds the second bedroom and dining-area care. A 3 BHK (₹1,699, 3–4 hours) extends to the third bedroom, study corners, utility areas and longer balcony runs. Timings assume normal upkeep condition; first visits after a gap run longer and are quoted upfront.

Cadence decides results more than any single visit. Weekly plans suit homes near active construction (Dwarka Expressway, Golf Course Extension, Sohna Road corridors), pet owners and cooking-heavy kitchens — dust and oil mist never get a week to bond. Bi-weekly fits dust-managed towers with working couples out all day. Monthly works only as a supplement between quarterly deep cleans. The math is simple: a ₹1,199 weekly 2 BHK habit (~₹4,800 a month) postpones every ₹4,500 deep clean by months, because limescale, grout dye and baked grease never accumulate to deep-clean grade.

Who books scheduled house cleaning here falls into four groups. Working couples out 10–12 hours who return to a reset home. Seniors who want verified visitors on a fixed weekday rhythm. Landlords running turnover cleans between tenants — same checklist, empty-flat edition, photographed for records. And pet owners, for whom HEPA vacuuming and non-toxic products are the actual product, not a footnote.`,image:`/images/house-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Residential house cleaning service in Gurgaon by police-verified team from Sachin Deep Cleaning`,includes:[`Full dusting & vacuuming`,`Mopping & floor care`,`Kitchen & bathroom upkeep`,`Bin emptying & liner change`,`Surface wiping & sanitation`,`Bed-making & tidying (optional)`,`HEPA vacuum & microfiber kit included`,`Same team on recurring plans`,`Weekly / bi-weekly / monthly plans`,`Eco-friendly products`],process:[{step:1,title:`Book a Slot`,desc:`Pick one-time or a recurring plan that suits your routine.`},{step:2,title:`Confirm Checklist`,desc:`We confirm rooms, add-ons and the exact price on the call.`},{step:3,title:`Clean`,desc:`Our team cleans thoroughly using your approved checklist.`},{step:4,title:`Inspect & Relax`,desc:`Walk through the home, approve the work, then enjoy a fresh space.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does house cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`House cleaning starts at ₹499 per visit for a studio apartment. A 1 BHK is around ₹799, a 2 BHK ₹1,199 and a 3 BHK ₹1,699. Weekly plans work out cheaper per visit.`},{q:`Can I schedule recurring cleaning?`,a:`Yes — we offer weekly, bi-weekly and monthly house cleaning plans across Gurgaon, with the same trusted team assigned to your home every time.`},{q:`Are products pet-safe?`,a:`We use non-toxic, eco-friendly solutions that are completely safe around pets and children.`},{q:`Do I need to be present during cleaning?`,a:`Not necessarily. Many customers leave a key with us or share access instructions. We do a final walkthrough together so you can approve the work.`},{q:`Do you clean balconies and utility areas?`,a:`Yes — balconies, utility areas, stairwells and passages inside the home are included in the standard house cleaning checklist.`},{q:`What is included in a standard house cleaning visit?`,a:`A standard house cleaning visit includes full dusting and vacuuming, mopping all floors, kitchen surface wiping, bathroom cleaning, bin emptying, and surface sanitation. Bed-making and dish washing are available as add-ons.`},{q:`How long does a house cleaning visit take?`,a:`A 1 BHK takes approximately 1.5–2 hours. A 2 BHK takes 2–3 hours. A 3 BHK takes 3–4 hours. The exact time depends on the current state of the home.`},{q:`Is house cleaning different from deep cleaning?`,a:`Yes. House cleaning covers regular visible surfaces — sweeping, mopping, wiping and bathroom upkeep. Deep cleaning is a thorough one-time or quarterly service that reaches behind furniture, inside cabinets, grout lines and every surface including those cleaning routinely misses.`},{q:`Can I get the same cleaner every time?`,a:`On weekly and bi-weekly plans, we assign the same team to your home so they know your preferences and you build familiarity. Occasional cancellations may require a substitute — we always inform you in advance.`},{q:`Gurgaon me house cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`House cleaning ₹499 (studio) se shuru hoti hai. 1 BHK ₹799, 2 BHK ₹1,199, 3 BHK ₹1,699 per visit. Weekly plan me per-visit cost kam ho jati hai.`},{q:`Kya weekly house cleaning plan lena fayde-mand hai?`,a:`Haan — weekly plan me same team aati hai aur dust buildup kam rehta hai, jisse deep cleaning ki zarurat bhi kam padti hai. Cost per visit bhi kam hoti hai.`},{q:`What does a house cleaning service in Gurgaon cover that a maid does not?`,a:`Three things: equipment (HEPA vacuum, microfiber systems, extension dusting a maid typically lacks), a written room-by-room checklist that is identical every visit, and supervision with pay-after-walkthrough terms. A maid keeps daily order; a house cleaning service in Gurgaon resets upkeep-grade buildup on a schedule with verified staff.`},{q:`Which plan suits a 2 BHK working couple — weekly or bi-weekly?`,a:`Weekly if the tower faces construction dust, you cook daily, or anyone has dust allergies — a 2 BHK at ₹1,199 a visit stays ahead of buildup. Bi-weekly works for dust-managed towers where both partners travel frequently. Start bi-weekly; upgrade if bathroom film or dust return before the next visit.`},{q:`Do you bring your own vacuum, mop and products?`,a:`Yes — the team arrives with a HEPA vacuum, microfiber cloths and mops, plus eco-friendly sprays. You provide only water and power access. Products are non-toxic and safe around children and pets, with no harsh chemical smell left behind.`},{q:`How do I pause or reschedule a weekly plan?`,a:`One WhatsApp message before noon reschedules or pauses your slot — travel, guests or festivals included, with no pause fee. The same team resumes on your return, and the checklist picks up exactly where it left off.`},{q:`Can I book a one-time house cleaning service in Gurgaon for a move-out?`,a:`Yes — one-time visits use the same checklist in an empty-flat edition: inside cabinets and wardrobes, balcony and utility detailing, and photo documentation for landlord handover. Tell us it is a move-out on booking so the crew allocates the extra hour.`}],reviews:[[`NV`,`Nisha Verma`,`Sector 56`,`Weekly house cleaning plan — the same two cleaners every time, and the flat is always spotless when I come home.`],[`RK`,`Rahul Khanna`,`Palam Vihar`,`Booked a one-time deep clean then switched to the monthly plan. Great value and very consistent quality.`],[`TM`,`Tanya Malhotra`,`Sushant Lok 1`,`They clean around my schedule and my dog loves them. Eco-friendly products, no strong smells.`]],price:n.house},kitchen:{name:`Kitchen Deep Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`A hygienic, grease-free cooking space.`,intro:`We degrease chimneys, cabinets, countertops and appliances so your kitchen is safe and sparkling.`,detail:`A kitchen is the hardest-working room in any Gurgaon home — and the most neglected during routine cleaning. Daily cooking leaves a stubborn layer of grease on chimney filters, exhaust fans, stove burners, cabinet doors and the tiles behind the hob. That sticky film collects dust and can turn into tough, baked-on grime over just a few months.

Our kitchen deep cleaning service dismantles and degreases the chimney and exhaust fan, scrubs every cabinet inside and out, descales the sink and taps, cleans the stove, hob and microwave, wipes splashback tiles and grout, and finishes with the kitchen floor. We use food-safe, eco-friendly degreasers so your cooking surfaces stay hygienic for your family. A standard kitchen takes 3–4 hours with a 1–2 cleaner team.`,image:`/images/kitchen-deep-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Kitchen deep cleaning in Gurgaon — professional chimney degreasing and cabinet cleaning by Sachin Deep Cleaning`,includes:[`Chimney filter degreasing & washing`,`Exhaust fan dismantle & clean`,`Stove & hob scrub`,`Cabinet interiors & exteriors`,`Sink & tap descaling`,`Splashback tile & grout scrub`,`Microwave & countertop detail`,`Kitchen floor degreasing`],process:[{step:1,title:`Clear & Protect`,desc:`We clear counters and protect surfaces before starting.`},{step:2,title:`Degrease`,desc:`Chimney, exhaust, hob and tiles are degreased with food-safe products.`},{step:3,title:`Detail`,desc:`Cabinets, drawers, sink and appliances are scrubbed inside and out.`},{step:4,title:`Sanitize`,desc:`Surfaces are wiped down with a hygienic final disinfection.`}],faqs:[{q:`Do you clean the chimney filter?`,a:`Yes — we dismantle the filter and wash it with a powerful degreaser so suction is restored, not just wiped over.`},{q:`How long does kitchen deep cleaning take?`,a:`A standard Gurgaon kitchen takes about 3–4 hours. Larger modular kitchens or heavy grease buildup may take longer.`},{q:`Are the cleaning products food-safe?`,a:`Yes — we only use food-safe, eco-friendly degreasers and disinfectants on all cooking and food-contact surfaces.`},{q:`How often should I deep clean my kitchen?`,a:`Every 2–3 months for daily-cooking kitchens. Chimney filters should be cleaned even more regularly to prevent grease buildup and keep the exhaust working.`},{q:`Do you clean inside the refrigerator?`,a:`Fridge deep cleaning is available as an add-on. The standard kitchen package covers the chimney, hob, cabinets, sink, tiles and countertops.`},{q:`How much does kitchen deep cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Kitchen deep cleaning in Gurgaon costs approximately ₹1,500–₹2,500 depending on kitchen size and the level of grease buildup. The chimney filter clean is included. WhatsApp us for a fixed quote.`},{q:`Do you clean inside kitchen cabinets?`,a:`Yes — inside and outside of all cabinets and drawers are cleaned as part of the kitchen deep clean package. Expired items you want removed should be cleared before the team arrives.`},{q:`Can you clean a modular kitchen?`,a:`Yes — we have experience with modular kitchens including tall units, pull-out drawers, basket inserts and built-in chimneys. We clean carefully without disturbing fittings or mechanisms.`},{q:`Is kitchen deep cleaning the same as chimney servicing?`,a:`No. Kitchen deep cleaning includes a thorough chimney filter clean and body wipe-down, but does not include motor servicing or warranty-covered repair work. For motor or electrical issues, contact your chimney brand's service center.`},{q:`Gurgaon me kitchen deep cleaning kitne ka hai?`,a:`Standard kitchen deep cleaning ₹1,500–₹2,500 ke beech me hoti hai. Chimney filter cleaning isme shamil hai. WhatsApp par fixed quote milta hai.`},{q:`Chimney filter kitni baar saaf karna chahiye?`,a:`Roz cooking hone par har 1–2 mahine me filter saaf karna chahiye. Pura chimney deep clean har 6–12 mahine me karwaye.`}],reviews:[[`PK`,`Pooja Khurana`,`Sohna Road`,`The chimney filter looked like new after they were done. My kitchen finally smells clean, not of old cooking oil.`],[`SM`,`Shalini Mehra`,`DLF Phase 4`,`They took apart the exhaust fan and hob and degreased everything. Grease I thought was permanent is completely gone.`],[`RJ`,`Ritika Jain`,`Sector 49`,`Very thorough — even the cabinet interiors and the top of the chimney were cleaned. Worth booking every quarter.`]],price:n.kitchen},bathroom:{name:`Bathroom Deep Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Germ-free, sparkling bathrooms.`,intro:`Descaling tiles, faucets, commodes and exhaust fans — we leave your bathroom hygienic and fresh.`,detail:`Gurgaon’s hard water is brutal on bathrooms. It leaves white limescale on faucets, taps, shower heads and mirrors, yellows the grout between tiles, and stains the corners of the commode and bath. Left alone, moisture also invites mould and soap scum in hidden corners that a routine mop never touches.

Our [bathroom deep cleaning](/blog/bathroom-deep-cleaning-gurgaon-best.html) service removes limescale and [hard-water stains](/blog/hard-water-bathroom-stains-gurgaon.html) from tiles, faucets, shower heads and glass, scrubs grout lines, fully sanitizes the commode inside and out, cleans the basin, exhaust fan and mirror, and finishes with the floor and wall tiles. We use disinfectants and rinse-safe products so the bathroom is safe for kids. A single bathroom typically takes 1.5–2 hours with one expert cleaner.`,image:`/images/bathroom-deep-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Bathroom deep cleaning removing hard water stains from tiles and taps in a Gurgaon home`,includes:[`Tile & grout descaling`,`Faucet, shower & tap de-scaling`,`Commode sanitization inside & out`,`Basin & mirror polishing`,`Exhaust fan cleaning`,`Mould & soap scum removal`,`Glass & shower panel cleaning`,`Floor scrub & disinfection`],process:[{step:1,title:`Descale`,desc:`Hard-water stains and limescale are dissolved off fixtures and tiles.`},{step:2,title:`Scrub`,desc:`Grout, corners and the commode are scrubbed clean.`},{step:3,title:`Sanitize`,desc:`Every surface is disinfected with rinse-safe products.`},{step:4,title:`Shine`,desc:`Glass, mirrors and chrome are polished to finish.`}],faqs:[{q:`Do you remove hard-water stains?`,a:`Yes — we use professional descalers that dissolve Gurgaon’s limescale from taps, shower heads, glass and tiles.`},{q:`How long does a bathroom deep clean take?`,a:`Around 1.5–2 hours per bathroom with one expert cleaner. Larger bathrooms or heavy staining can take longer.`},{q:`Is it safe for kids?`,a:`Absolutely — we use non-toxic, rinse-safe products that leave no harsh chemical residue.`},{q:`Can you remove mould from bathroom corners?`,a:`Yes — mould and soap scum are treated and scrubbed off grout, silicone and tile corners as part of the deep clean.`},{q:`Do you clean the exhaust fan and ventilation?`,a:`Yes, the exhaust fan grill and blades are cleaned and the vent wiped down during the deep clean.`},{q:`How much does bathroom deep cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Bathroom deep cleaning in Gurgaon costs approximately ₹800–₹1,200 per bathroom. If you book bathroom cleaning as part of a full-home deep clean, it is included in the overall home price.`},{q:`Why do bathroom tiles get stained so fast in Gurgaon?`,a:`Gurgaon's water supply has a very high TDS (Total Dissolved Solids) level — often 800–1,200 mg/L. Every drop of water that evaporates leaves mineral deposits behind. This is why tiles, faucets and shower glass in Gurgaon show hard water stains faster than in most other Indian cities.`},{q:`Do you clean the inside of the commode tank?`,a:`The standard bathroom deep clean covers the commode bowl, rim, base and seat. The inside of the water tank is available as an add-on — request it when booking.`},{q:`How long after bathroom cleaning can I use it?`,a:`Usually 30–60 minutes after cleaning is complete. We use rinse-safe products and always do a final water rinse, so the bathroom is safe to use immediately once surfaces are dry.`},{q:`Gurgaon me ek bathroom deep cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Ek bathroom ki deep cleaning ₹800 se ₹1,200 tak hoti hai. Full home package me ye price shamil ho jati hai.`},{q:`Hard water ke daag kaise hatate hain?`,a:`Hum professional descaler use karte hain jo Gurgaon ke hard water ke lime scale ko tap, shower aur glass se hata deta hai.`}],reviews:[[`AS`,`Anita Sharma`,`Sector 45`,`Hard water stains on our shower glass were driving me crazy. They came off completely. Bathroom looks brand new.`],[`DP`,`Deepak Puri`,`MG Road`,`Very impressed with the commode sanitization and tile scrubbing. Thorough and hygienic, no shortcuts.`],[`SG`,`Sneha Gupta`,`Golf Course Extension`,`They even cleaned the exhaust fan and ceiling corners. The bathroom smells fresh days later. Great service.`]],price:n.bathroom},sofa:{name:`Sofa Shampoo Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Revive your upholstery.`,intro:`Steam and shampoo cleaning removes stains, dust mites and odors from sofas, mattresses and cushions.`,detail:`Your sofa takes a daily beating — drinks spilled, kids climbing, pets curling up, and fine Gurgaon dust settling deep into the fabric. Over time, that invisible buildup turns fabric dull, triggers allergies, and traps odors that air fresheners simply mask.

Our sofa shampoo cleaning uses a hot-water extraction and low-moisture method to flush out embedded dirt, dust mites and allergens, lift stains and neutralize odors. We first assess the fabric — cotton, linen, jacquard, velvet or leather — and choose the right treatment. Leather sofas receive a gentle conditioner-safe clean instead of shampoo. Prices start at ₹499 per seat for dry cleaning and ₹599 per seat for shampoo extraction. A 3-seater usually takes 1.5–2 hours and dries in 4–6 hours, ready for the evening.`,image:`/images/sofa-shampoo-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Sofa shampoo cleaning in Gurgaon — stain removal and fabric-safe extraction by Sachin Deep Cleaning`,includes:[`Deep vacuum before treatment`,`Stain pre-treatment & removal`,`Fabric-safe shampoo & extraction`,`Dust-mite & allergen removal`,`Odor neutralization`,`Leather-safe conditioning option`,`Cushion & pillow cover care`,`Quick-dry low-moisture finish`],process:[{step:1,title:`Vacuum`,desc:`Loose dirt and dust are extracted from the fabric.`},{step:2,title:`Pre-treat`,desc:`Stains are treated with fabric-appropriate solutions.`},{step:3,title:`Shampoo & Extract`,desc:`Foam is worked in and dirt and moisture are extracted.`},{step:4,title:`Dry & Protect`,desc:`The sofa is dried and, if needed, protected.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does sofa cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Sofa cleaning starts at ₹499 per seat for dry cleaning and ₹599 per seat for shampoo/steam extraction. A 3-seater is typically ₹1,500–1,800.`},{q:`How long to dry?`,a:`Typically 4–6 hours in normal room conditions. We use a low-moisture extraction so your sofa is usually ready by the evening.`},{q:`Is it safe for all fabrics?`,a:`We assess the fabric first and use the right method — shampoo extraction for cotton and polyester blends, gentle methods for silk, velvet and leather.`},{q:`Will it remove old stains?`,a:`We pre-treat and extract most set-in stains. Very old or permanent marks (like ink or bleach) may lighten but cannot always be fully removed — we will tell you honestly before starting.`},{q:`Does cleaning remove dust mites?`,a:`Yes — the deep vacuum plus extraction removes dust mites, their droppings and allergens, which helps with allergy symptoms.`},{q:`Is shampoo cleaning better than dry cleaning for sofas?`,a:`For embedded dirt, strong odors or significant stains, hot-water extraction (shampoo method) is more effective. Dry cleaning is a good choice for routine maintenance or for delicate fabrics that should not get wet.`},{q:`Can you clean a leather sofa?`,a:`Yes — leather sofas are cleaned with a leather-safe conditioner cleaner, not shampoo or water. The process removes surface dirt, conditions the leather and helps prevent cracking. Please mention leather when booking.`},{q:`Do you clean mattresses too?`,a:`Yes — mattress steam cleaning removes dust mites, allergens and bacteria. It is available as an add-on to sofa cleaning. Booking both together on the same visit is the most cost-effective option.`},{q:`How often should I get my sofa professionally cleaned in Gurgaon?`,a:`Once a year for households without pets or children. Every 6 months for families with children or pets. Every 3–4 months for high-allergy households or homes with multiple pets.`},{q:`Gurgaon me sofa cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Sofa cleaning ₹499 per seat (dry) aur ₹599 per seat (shampoo extraction) se shuru hoti hai. 3-seater sofa ke liye ₹1,500–₹1,800 lagta hai.`},{q:`Sofa cleaning ke baad kitni der tak use nahi karna?`,a:`4–6 ghante — hum low-moisture extraction use karte hain, isliye sofa usi shaam tak sukh jata hai aur ready ho jata hai.`}],reviews:[[`VK`,`Vikas Khandelwal`,`Sushant Lok 1`,`Three-year-old sofas came back looking new. The water after extraction was black — clearly years of dust. Great value.`],[`MR`,`Meghna Rao`,`Sector 66`,`My cream fabric sofa had a stubborn coffee stain that other services said was permanent. They got most of it out. Impressed.`],[`NA`,`Nikhil Arora`,`Palam Vihar`,`Pet odor is gone completely. They were careful with the fabric and it dried the same evening.`]],price:n.sofa},carpet:{name:`Carpet Shampoo Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Deep clean for brighter carpets.`,intro:`We extract embedded dirt, stains and allergens so your carpets look and feel new.`,detail:`Carpets are dust magnets — especially in Gurgaon, where fine particulate and construction dust settle straight into the pile. Everyday vacuuming only lifts the surface; the deep dirt, pet hair, dust mites and spilled stains stay trapped below, dulling colours and triggering allergies. A carpet that looks “okay” at a glance can hold years of embedded soil that only hot-water extraction removes — our vacuum test on first visits across DLF, Sohna Road and Golf Course Road homes routinely surprises owners.

Our carpet shampoo cleaning uses hot-water extraction to flush out deep-seated dirt and allergens, pre-treats stubborn stains and neutralizes odours, leaving your carpet visibly brighter and fresher. We clean wall-to-wall carpets, area rugs and runners, and assess the fibre — wool, nylon, polyester — before choosing the right treatment. Pricing is by area: from ₹15 per square foot for dry cleaning and ₹18 per square foot for shampoo extraction. A large living-room carpet typically dries within 4–6 hours.

Vacuum cleaning services between professional visits keep the surface honest: twice-weekly slow passes (not quick glides) halve the soil load our extraction must lift. Homes with pets or young children should vacuum high-traffic lanes every other day and book extraction every 4–6 months; regularly vacuumed adult-only homes can stretch to 12 months. After renovation dust, flooding or a major spill, book immediately — settled cement and moisture bond fast in Gurgaon’s climate.`,image:`/images/carpet-shampoo-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Carpet shampoo cleaning Gurgaon — deep extraction of dirt, stains and allergens`,includes:[`Deep pre-vacuum`,`Stain pre-treatment`,`Hot-water shampoo extraction`,`Allergen & dust-mite removal`,`Odor neutralization`,`Wall-to-wall & area rugs`,`Fibre-safe treatment`,`Quick-dry finish`],process:[{step:1,title:`Pre-treat`,desc:`Stains are spotted and treated with fibre-safe solutions.`},{step:2,title:`Agitate`,desc:`Shampoo is worked into the pile to lift dirt.`},{step:3,title:`Extract`,desc:`Dirty water and residue are rinsed and extracted.`},{step:4,title:`Dry`,desc:`Air flow speeds up drying so your carpet is ready sooner.`}],faqs:[{q:`Do you clean rugs too?`,a:`Yes — wall-to-wall carpets, area rugs, runners and dhurries are all covered.`},{q:`How much does carpet cleaning cost?`,a:`From ₹15 per square foot for dry cleaning and ₹18 per square foot for shampoo extraction. The exact quote is confirmed after measuring the carpet.`},{q:`How long to dry?`,a:`About 4–6 hours depending on carpet thickness and room ventilation. We use extraction methods that leave minimal moisture.`},{q:`Can you remove pet stains and odours?`,a:`Yes — pet stains are pre-treated and odours are neutralized with enzyme-safe solutions during extraction.`},{q:`Is it safe for wool carpets?`,a:`Yes — we adjust the pH and cleaning method for natural fibres like wool so they are cleaned without shrinking or damage.`},{q:`What is the carpet cleaning rate per square foot in Gurgaon?`,a:`Carpet cleaning rates in Gurgaon are ₹15 per square foot for dry cleaning and ₹18 per square foot for shampoo hot-water extraction. A 10×12 ft carpet (120 sq ft) costs ₹1,800–₹2,160.`},{q:`Can you clean Kashmiri or Persian carpets?`,a:`High-value handmade carpets like Kashmiri, Persian or silk rugs require specialist care. We assess the fibre and dye stability before cleaning. For very valuable rugs, we recommend professional rug washers who specialize in antique pieces.`},{q:`How do you prevent colour bleeding during carpet cleaning?`,a:`We test for colour bleeding on a small hidden area before treating the full carpet. For carpets with vibrant or dark colours, we use a pH-neutral, colour-safe extraction solution.`},{q:`How often should carpets be professionally cleaned in Gurgaon?`,a:`Every 6–12 months for regularly vacuumed carpets. Every 4–6 months for homes with pets or young children. After any significant soiling event (flood, spill, construction dust) — immediately.`},{q:`Gurgaon me carpet cleaning ka rate kya hai?`,a:`Carpet cleaning ₹15 per sq ft (dry) aur ₹18 per sq ft (shampoo extraction) se hoti hai. 10×12 ft carpet ke liye ₹1,800–₹2,160 lagta hai.`},{q:`Carpet cleaning ke baad kitna time drying me lagta hai?`,a:`4–6 ghante — extraction se paani nikala jata hai, isliye zyada moisture nahi rehta. Achhi ventilation me theek se sukh jata hai.`},{q:`Dry cleaning vs shampoo extraction — which carpet method do I need?`,a:`Dry cleaning (₹15/sq ft) suits lightly soiled carpets, delicate fibres and fastest turnaround — usable almost immediately. Shampoo hot-water extraction (₹18/sq ft) is the real deep clean for embedded dirt, pet stains, odours and allergens. Most Gurgaon homes with construction-dust exposure need extraction at least once a year.`},{q:`Can vacuum cleaning replace professional carpet shampoo?`,a:`No — vacuuming (even twice-weekly) removes only loose surface soil, roughly the top third of what sits in pile. Oils, mite waste, bonded dust and old stains need hot-water extraction. Think of vacuuming as brushing teeth and extraction as the dentist visit.`},{q:`Do you move furniture for wall-to-wall carpet cleaning?`,a:`Light furniture (coffee tables, chairs, floor lamps) is shifted and replaced as part of the job. Heavy items like beds and wardrobes are cleaned around unless you arrange shifting — tell us on the booking call and we plan crew size accordingly.`}],reviews:[[`KB`,`Kavita Bhatia`,`Sector 15`,`Our living room carpet was dull and musty. After the shampoo extraction it looks brighter and the room smells clean.`],[`SA`,`Sanjay Arora`,`DLF Phase 3`,`Fair per-sq-ft pricing and they measured honestly. Deep stains from the kids came out nicely.`],[`PR`,`Priyanka Reddy`,`Sohna Road`,`They cleaned our wall-to-wall carpet after renovation dust settled in. The amount of dirt extracted was shocking.`]],price:n.carpet},office:{name:`Office Deep Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Clean workspaces, fewer sick days.`,intro:`Office [deep cleaning services](/blog/deep-cleaning-services.html) in Gurgaon for IT parks, startups, clinics, shops and corporate floors — workstations, pantry, washrooms, carpets and glass. After-hours and weekend crews, GST invoice, NDA on request.`,detail:`First impressions matter. The condition of your office — sticky desks, stained carpets, grimy pantry and washrooms — says something about your company before a client says a word. More importantly, shared surfaces are the fastest way for germs to move through a team, and a deep clean every quarter measurably cuts sick days.

Our office deep cleaning service is built around your schedule. We work after hours, early mornings or weekends so your team never has to vacate mid-day. We clean and sanitize workstations (desks, monitors, keyboards, chairs), pantries and kitchens, restrooms, glass partitions, reception and conference rooms, and shampoo carpets or scrub tile floors. Our background-checked staff can sign NDAs if your policy requires it. Pricing depends on floor area and scope — we give you an itemized quote before we start.

One crew covers every commercial vertical in Gurgaon: IT and BPO floors, coworking spaces, clinics and labs, retail shops and showrooms, restaurants and cafés, salons, schools, showrooms and warehouses. Clinics get disinfection-grade washroom protocols; food outlets get exhaust degreasing and drain care; IT floors get dry anti-static server-zone methods with your IT team in the loop. Shops and clinics under 1,000 sq ft typically run ₹5,000–₹8,000; larger floors quote per square foot after a free site survey.

We serve every business hub — Cyber City and Cyber Hub, Udyog Vihar Phase 1–5, Golf Course Road and Extension, Sohna Road tech parks, MG Road and DLF Phase 1–5, Sector 32/44/54 corridors, and Manesar/IMT industrial offices. Facility desks get GST invoices with scope lines, staff ID records, chemical MSDS sheets on request and photo-logged walkthrough reports — the documentation audits actually ask for. Serving Gurgaon businesses since 2015.`,image:`/images/office-deep-cleaning.jpg`,imageAlt:`Office deep cleaning after hours in Gurgaon — workstations, pantry and washrooms cleaned`,includes:[`Workstation deep clean — desks, monitors, keyboards, chairs`,`Pantry & kitchen area — degreasing, countertops, sinks, exhaust fan`,`Restrooms — tile & grout scrub, WC descaling, mirror polish`,`Floor care — tile scrub or carpet shampoo / hot-water extraction`,`Glass & partition cleaning — cabins, conference rooms, entrance doors`,`Ceiling & walls — AC vents, fan blades, cobwebs, switchboards`,`Reception & lobby — desk, waiting-area upholstery, high-dusting`,`Waste management — bin sanitising & liner replacement`,`Server & IT zones — dry anti-static dust control, no liquids without IT supervision`,`Pantry deep degrease — exhaust, appliances, drains and floor traps`,`Conference & cabins — table polish, glass partitions, chair shampoo on request`,`Compliance pack — GST invoice, staff IDs, photo-logged walkthrough report`],process:[{step:1,title:`Survey & Quote`,desc:`We survey the floor area and give an itemized, fixed quote.`},{step:2,title:`Schedule Off-Hours`,desc:`Cleaning is booked after hours or at weekends.`},{step:3,title:`Deep Clean`,desc:`Zones are cleaned top-to-bottom with commercial equipment.`},{step:4,title:`Verify`,desc:`A supervisor checks quality before your walkthrough.`}],faqs:[{q:`Can you clean after hours?`,a:`Yes — early morning, evening/night, and weekend slots at no extra charge. Your employees never need to vacate mid-day.`},{q:`Do you sign NDAs?`,a:`Background-checked staff; NDAs available if your company policy requires it.`},{q:`How often should an office be deep cleaned?`,a:`Every 3 months for most Gurgaon offices. High-traffic offices with 100+ people benefit from monthly deep cleaning.`},{q:`Do you clean server rooms and IT areas?`,a:`We clean around server rooms using dry, anti-static methods only. We never use liquids near electrical or IT equipment unless your IT team supervises it.`},{q:`What is the difference from daily housekeeping?`,a:`Daily housekeeping sweeps, mops and empties bins. Deep cleaning scrubs grout, descales taps, shampoos carpets, cleans AC vents and degreases kitchen exhausts — a full reset.`},{q:`How much does office deep cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Office deep cleaning in Gurgaon is priced by area and scope. A small office under 1,000 sq ft typically costs ₹5,000–₹8,000. Larger commercial spaces are assessed on-site for a custom quote.`},{q:`Do you clean computer monitors, keyboards and electronics?`,a:`We clean external surfaces of monitors, keyboards, phones and desk equipment with anti-static, electronics-safe wipes. We do not clean internal components or open equipment casings.`},{q:`Can you handle post-renovation office cleaning?`,a:`Yes — post-renovation office cleaning removes construction dust from HVAC vents, false ceilings, flooring, glass and all surfaces. This is priced separately from standard office deep cleaning due to the extra scope.`},{q:`Do you provide regular office cleaning contracts?`,a:`Yes — we offer weekly, bi-weekly and monthly housekeeping contracts for offices in Gurgaon. WhatsApp +91 95607 39281 to discuss a custom contract for your workspace.`},{q:`What is included in an office deep clean?`,a:`Workstations (desks, monitors, keyboards, chairs), pantry degreasing, restroom tile-grout scrub and WC descaling, carpet shampoo or tile scrub, glass partitions and cabins, AC vents and high-dusting, reception and lobby, plus bin sanitising. Server zones get dry anti-static methods only. Every job ends with a supervisor walkthrough and photo log.`},{q:`What is the office deep cleaning price list in Gurgaon?`,a:`Small offices under 1,000 sq ft: ₹5,000–₹8,000. Mid floors (1,000–5,000 sq ft): roughly ₹3–₹11 per sq ft by scope. Monthly housekeeping staff: ~₹14,000–₹18,000 per person per shift. Our quotes itemise everything before arrival — no hidden charges, GST invoice included for facility desks.`},{q:`Which are the best office deep cleaning services in Gurgaon?`,a:`Judge by corporate proof: GST invoicing, staff IDs with verification, NDA readiness, after-hours crews, and hub-tagged references (Cyber City, Udyog Vihar). Our best-office comparison scores the top office deep cleaning services Gurgaon options head-to-head — read it on our blog before deciding.`},{q:`Do you serve Cyber City, Udyog Vihar and Golf Course Road offices?`,a:`Yes — those three plus Sohna Road tech parks, MG Road/DLF Phase 1–5, Sector 32/44/54 corridors and Manesar/IMT industrial offices. After-hours and weekend crews across all hubs at no extra charge.`},{q:`Do you clean clinics, shops and restaurants too?`,a:`Yes — clinics get disinfection-grade washroom and waiting-area protocols; shops/showrooms get glass, floors and trial-area detailing; restaurants get exhaust degreasing and drain care. Each vertical follows its own checklist, priced per sq ft after a free survey.`},{q:`Do you provide GST invoices and documentation for facility audits?`,a:`Yes — GST invoice with scope lines, staff ID and verification records, chemical MSDS sheets on request, and photo-logged walkthrough reports. NDAs signed where your policy requires. Facility desks in Cyber City and Udyog Vihar clear them routinely.`}],reviews:[[`HG`,`Hitesh Gupta`,`Corporate Office, Cyber City`,`They cleaned our 2-floor office on a Sunday with zero disruption. Carpets and washrooms were spotless by Monday morning.`],[`LS`,`Lata Srivastava`,`Startup Office, Udyog Vihar`,`NDA signed, team professional, and the pantry grease was finally gone. Booked them again for the quarterly clean.`],[`AC`,`Anuj Chawla`,`Clinic, Sector 44`,`For a medical setup hygiene is everything. Their sanitization of our waiting area and washrooms was thorough and documented.`]],price:n.office},move:{name:`Move-In / Move-Out Cleaning in Gurgaon`,tagline:`Leave it spotless — or move into one.`,intro:`End-to-end cleaning for tenants and owners: every room detailed so you hand over or settle in with confidence.`,detail:`Moving is stressful enough without adding cleaning to the pile. Whether you are a tenant trying to get your full security deposit back or a new owner walking into a space that has seen years of someone else’s use, our move-in / move-out cleaning takes care of every corner.

For move-outs, we work to landlord checklists so nothing is left to argue about — [kitchen degreased](/kitchen-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html), [bathrooms descaled](/bathroom-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html), windows washed, walls spot-cleaned, floors scrubbed and cabinets emptied. For move-ins, we make the space hygienic and ready: sanitizing kitchens and bathrooms, wiping cabinet interiors, cleaning windows and giving the floors a [deep scrub](/deep-cleaning-services-in-gurgaon.html) before your furniture arrives. We cover [apartments and villas across Gurgaon](/residential-cleaners-near-me.html) and can work around your handover date, even same-day in many sectors.`,image:`/images/full-home-deep-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Move-in move-out deep cleaning checklist complete — spotless empty apartment in Gurgaon`,includes:[`Full empty-home deep clean`,`Kitchen degreasing & sanitization`,`Bathroom descaling & disinfection`,`Cabinet & cupboard interior wipe`,`Windows, sills & glass cleaning`,`Wall spot-cleaning & cobweb removal`,`Floor & tile deep scrub`,`Landlord checklist sign-off`],process:[{step:1,title:`Assess`,desc:`We confirm the scope and your handover date.`},{step:2,title:`Deep Clean`,desc:`Every room is cleaned top-to-bottom to a checklist.`},{step:3,title:`Handover`,desc:`The space is ready for keys — or ready to live in.`}],faqs:[{q:`How far in advance should I book?`,a:`24–48 hours is ideal. We often have same-day slots available — WhatsApp to check.`},{q:`Is move-out cleaning the same as deep cleaning?`,a:`Move-out cleaning is a specific type of deep clean focused on restoring the flat to handover condition — every surface, every room, every fixture. It is typically more thorough than a standard deep clean because the flat is empty.`},{q:`Do you clean empty flats only?`,a:`Move-in and move-out cleaning is designed for empty or near-empty flats. We can work around furniture but an empty flat gives the team full access for the most thorough result.`},{q:`How much does move-out cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Move-in and move-out cleaning in Gurgaon costs ₹3,000–₹8,000 depending on flat size. A 2 BHK empty flat typically costs ₹4,000–₹5,500. WhatsApp for a fixed quote based on your flat size.`},{q:`Will move-out cleaning help me get my security deposit back?`,a:`A professional move-out clean significantly improves your chances of a full deposit return. Landlords and property managers primarily inspect the kitchen, bathrooms, floors and walls — all of which are thoroughly cleaned in our move-out service.`},{q:`What does move-in cleaning include?`,a:`Move-in cleaning covers the full flat: kitchen (chimney, cabinets, hob, sink, tiles), all bathrooms (tile descaling, commode sanitization), all rooms (floor to ceiling dusting, mopping), balconies, windows and all fixtures. We leave the flat genuinely clean before your belongings arrive.`},{q:`Can you clean a flat that has been vacant for a long time?`,a:`Yes — long-vacant flats with accumulated dust, pest evidence or water damage are assessed first. We advise on scope and provide a full quote. This may require more time and specialized treatment for certain areas.`},{q:`Do you offer same-day move-in cleaning in Gurgaon?`,a:`Yes — same-day slots are available subject to team availability. For move-in cleaning where timing is tight, WhatsApp +91 95607 39281 first thing in the morning for the best chance of a same-day slot.`},{q:`Gurgaon me move-in move-out cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Move-in/out cleaning ₹1,999 se shuru hoti hai. 2 BHK empty flat ke liye ₹4,000–₹5,500 lagta hai. Flat size ke hisaab se price fix ho jati hai.`},{q:`Move-out cleaning se security deposit wapas milega kya?`,a:`Haan — professional move-out clean se full deposit wapas milne ke chances badh jaate hain. Landlord kitchen, bathroom, floor aur walls check karte hain, jo hum thoroughly saaf karte hain.`}],reviews:[[`RV`,`Rohan Vashist`,`Rented out 2 BHK, Sector 70`,`Got my full security deposit back thanks to their checklist-driven clean. Landlord even complimented the handover.`],[`PD`,`Pallavi Dua`,`Moved into 3 BHK, Golf Course Rd`,`Moved into a home that smelled of previous owners. Their move-in clean made it feel brand new.`],[`AS`,`Arvind Singh`,`Sector 82`,`Booked on the day of handover — they finished before the landlord arrived. Efficient and thorough.`]],price:n.move},fullhome:{name:`Full Home Deep Cleaning`,tagline:`Every room, floor to ceiling.`,intro:`Book a complete deep cleaning of your entire home now with fixed prices for 1 BHK to 5 BHK in Gurgaon and same-day slots available.`,detail:`A full home deep cleaning is the flagship service — every room, every corner, cleaned in one coordinated visit. Our team of 3–5 professional cleaners works through bedrooms, living areas, kitchen, bathrooms, balconies and hallways, so the whole home is restored at once.

We price by home size and setup. Non-furnished homes (1 RK from ₹2,000, 1 BHK from ₹2,500, 2 BHK from ₹4,500) are the fastest to clean. Furnished homes cost a little more because every piece of furniture, upholstery and wardrobe needs careful detailing. The team brings all machines, eco-friendly products and equipment — you do not lift a finger. On the confirmation call we lock the exact price for your BHK, so there are no surprises on the day.`,image:`/images/full-home-deep-cleaning.webp`,imageAlt:`Full home deep cleaning in Gurgaon — every room cleaned floor to ceiling by Sachin Deep Cleaning team`,includes:[`All bedrooms & living areas`,`Kitchen deep cleaning`,`All bathrooms sanitized`,`Balconies & hallways`,`Furniture & fixture care`,`Window & glass cleaning`,`Sanitization of touch points`,`Eco-friendly products & equipment`],process:[{step:1,title:`Quote`,desc:`Share your BHK size and setup — we confirm the exact price.`},{step:2,title:`Schedule`,desc:`Pick a slot that suits you, same-day often available.`},{step:3,title:`Clean`,desc:`The whole home is detailed top-to-bottom by the full team.`},{step:4,title:`Relax`,desc:`Walk through, approve, and enjoy a fresh home.`}],faqs:[{q:`How much does full home deep cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`From ₹2,000 for a 1 RK (non-furnished). 1 BHK starts at ₹2,500, 2 BHK at ₹4,500, 3 BHK at ₹5,500, 4 BHK at ₹6,500 and 5 BHK at ₹9,000. Furnished homes cost slightly more.`},{q:`How long for a 2 BHK?`,a:`Usually 7–8 hours with a 4-person team. Bigger homes need more time and cleaners.`},{q:`Do you move furniture?`,a:`Light furniture is shifted to clean under and behind it; heavy items on request.`},{q:`What is the difference between furnished and non-furnished pricing?`,a:`Furnished homes include careful cleaning of every sofa, wardrobe, shelf and fixture, which takes more time — hence a slightly higher price than a non-furnished home of the same size.`},{q:`Do I need to be home during the cleaning?`,a:`Not for the whole visit — many customers leave access instructions. We do a final walkthrough together when you return.`},{q:`Full home cleaning me payment kab karna hota hai?`,a:`Payment walkthrough ke baad, satisfaction ke saath hoti hai. Advance nahi liya jata.`}],reviews:[[`PM`,`Priya Mehta`,`DLF Phase 3`,`Called them at 9 AM for same-day service. They arrived by 1 PM sharp and the house looked brand new. Kitchen deep clean was absolutely incredible.`],[`RG`,`Rohit Gupta`,`Sohna Road`,`Best value for money I have found in Gurgaon. Transparent pricing, no hidden charges, and the whole 2 BHK was done in one visit.`],[`VS`,`Vikram Sharma`,`MG Road`,`We have tried 3 other cleaning services before. None come close. Bathroom tiles look like they did when we first moved in. Just brilliant.`]],price:n.fullhome,priceByBhk:e,sqftByBhk:t},watertank:r,toilettank:i,facade:a,commonarea:o,sweeper:s,lift:c,windowgrill:l,utensils:u,road:d,chandelier:f,washingmachine:p,chairclean:m,curtain:h,basement:g,instantclean:_,balconyclean:v,sqftrate:y,kitchenplatform:b,postconstruction:x,roomclean:S};function w(e,t){let n=C[e]||C.deep,r={...n};if(e===`fullhome`&&t){var i,a,o;r.name=`${t} BHK Full Home Deep Cleaning`,r.price={label:`Starting from`,amount:((i=n.priceByBhk)==null?void 0:i[t])||`₹2,500`};let e={1:{intro:`Deep cleaning for a 1 BHK in Gurgaon — 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom, kitchen and small living — finished in a single visit, ₹2,500 fixed for non-furnished.`,detail:`A 1 BHK in Gurgaon is usually 400–600 sq ft — DLF Phase 1, Sohna Road, Palam Vihar studio apartments. Compact, but the hard water on that one bathroom and the grease in that small modular kitchen are the same problems a 3 BHK has, just concentrated. Most 1 BHK owners have lived with a "permanent" ring in the toilet bowl, a chimney filter that hasn't been washed in a year, and dust on the fan blades they can't reach. That's exactly what we fix.

A 1 BHK deep clean takes about 5–6 hours with a 2-person team. We dismantle the chimney filter, degrease the hob and exhaust fan, descale the single bathroom (tiles, taps, commode, shower glass), wipe inside the single wardrobe, mop and scrub the floor, clean the windows inside-out and sanitize high-touch surfaces. Light furniture is shifted to clean underneath; heavy items like a cot or fridge are cleaned around. Non-furnished 1 BHKs are ₹2,500; furnished with sofa or extra wardrobe is ₹3,000–₹3,500. The price is locked on the confirmation call before we start.

Most common reasons Gurgaon 1 BHK owners book us: end of lease / deposit handover, Diwali pre-clean, after a renovation in the same tower, or every 6 months when fine construction dust from nearby projects accumulates. Single-person households and young couples book us most.`,faqsExtra:[{q:`Do you clean inside the kitchen cabinets in a 1 BHK?`,a:`Yes — we empty and wipe inside all upper and lower cabinets, including corners where oil mist settles. In a small 1 BHK kitchen this is where 80% of the grime hides, so it is part of the standard package, not an add-on.`},{q:`How long does a 1 BHK deep cleaning take in Gurgaon?`,a:`A typical non-furnished 1 BHK takes 5–6 hours with 2 cleaners. Furnished 1 BHKs with sofa and wardrobe detailing take 6–7 hours. The team arrives at the agreed time and stays until the walkthrough is complete.`}]},2:{intro:`2 BHK full home deep cleaning in Gurgaon from ₹4,500 — 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, kitchen, balcony. Both bathrooms properly descaled, not just wiped. 7–8 hours, 3 cleaners.`,detail:`The 2 BHK is the most-booked size in Gurgaon — Sushant Lok, Golf Course Extension, South City 1, Sector 50–57, Palam Vihar. 601–1,000 sq ft, 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, a modular kitchen, a balcony, and usually a sofa that has seen better days. The most common complaint we hear: "the second bathroom is always rushed" or "the bathroom tiles still look patchy after cleaning". That happens because most services wipe the tiles, they don't descale them. We use a professional descaler that dissolves Gurgaon's 800–1,200 TDS limescale, then rinse and polish — that's the difference.

A 2 BHK deep clean takes 7–8 hours with 3 cleaners. Both bathrooms get full descaling (tiles, faucets, shower glass, commode, exhaust fan, mirror). The kitchen gets chimney dismantle + filter wash, hob and exhaust degrease, cabinet inside-out, tile scrub. Both bedrooms get wardrobe interior wipe, fan blade dust, window inside-out, floor scrub. The sofa gets a deep vacuum and spot pre-treatment — full shampoo is an add-on for ₹499/seat. The balcony gets a full scrub, including drainage corners where dust pools. Furnished 2 BHKs (with sofa, dining table, extra wardrobes) are ₹5,000–₹5,500; non-furnished ₹4,500. The price is fixed on the call before we dispatch.

Most common reasons 2 BHK owners book us: post-renovation, between tenants, quarterly family clean (especially with kids), Diwali pre-clean, or before a major gathering. The two-bathroom difference is what makes 2 BHK worth the upgrade from a 1 BHK clean — both bathrooms get the same attention.`,faqsExtra:[{q:`Why does my 2 BHK bathroom still look stained after cleaning?`,a:`Wiping tiles does not remove Gurgaon's hard-water limescale (TDS 800–1,200 mg/L). It bonds to the glaze and looks like a permanent stain. A professional descaler dissolves it in 5–10 minutes, then tiles rinse clean. If your last clean used only wipes or vinegar, the limescale is still there.`},{q:`Is sofa shampoo included in a 2 BHK deep clean?`,a:`Deep vacuum and spot pre-treatment are included. Full shampoo extraction is an add-on — ₹499/seat for dry clean, ₹599/seat for hot-water extraction. Most 2 BHK customers add the sofa in the same visit because the team is already on site and it costs less than booking separately.`}]},3:{intro:`3 BHK full home deep cleaning in Gurgaon from ₹5,500 — 3 bedrooms, 2–3 bathrooms, study, kitchen, balcony. AC vents, fan blades, and study detail included. 9–10 hours, 4 cleaners.`,detail:`The 3 BHK is the family-home sweet spot in Gurgaon — 1,001–1,500 sq ft, 3 bedrooms, 2 or 3 bathrooms, often a small study or store room, a bigger modular kitchen, and either one large or two smaller balconies. Most common in South City 1, Nirvana Country, Sector 50–57, and the [DLF Phase 2–4 belt](/blog/dlf-phase-3-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html). Three bedrooms means three wardrobes, three AC indoor units, three ceiling fans, and roughly 9 light fixtures that collect dust year-round. That is what the standard "maid cleaning" misses — the study dust, the AC vent dust, and the fan blades that haven't been wiped since the last tenant.

A 3 BHK deep clean takes 9–10 hours with 4 cleaners. AC vent covers are opened and dusted (this is the biggest single difference vs a regular clean). Ceiling fans across all 3 rooms are wiped blade-by-blade. The study gets bookshelf and desk detailing if the room is cleared beforehand. All 2–3 bathrooms get [full descaling](/bathroom-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html), not just a wipe. The kitchen gets the full [chimney dismantle + filter wash](/blog/kitchen-chimney-cleaning-guide.html) treatment — at this size, kitchens usually have a built-in oven, hob, and chimney, all of which need separate attention. Wardrobe interiors are wiped in all 3 bedrooms. The balcony drain corners are scrubbed. Furnished 3 BHKs (with sofa, dining, study furniture) are ₹6,000–₹6,500; non-furnished ₹5,500 — the figure in our [3 BHK price guide](/blog/3bhk-deep-cleaning-price-gurgaon.html). The price is fixed on the confirmation call.

Most common reasons 3 BHK families book us: [pre-Diwali](/blog/diwali-cleaning-gurgaon.html), post-renovation, before/after a long trip, between tenants in a rented home, or every 4–6 months because family life with kids or pets generates more buildup than weekly cleaning can keep up with.`,faqsExtra:[{q:`Do you clean AC vents and ceiling fans in a 3 BHK?`,a:`Yes — AC vent covers are opened, dusted, and wiped. Ceiling fan blades across all 3 bedrooms are wiped blade-by-blade. This is the single biggest difference between a "maid clean" and our 3 BHK deep clean — fan and vent dust is what most weekly cleaning routines skip, and it accumulates in 3 BHKs faster than smaller homes.`},{q:`How much extra is a furnished 3 BHK?`,a:`A furnished 3 BHK (sofa, dining table, study furniture, extra wardrobes) is ₹6,000–₹6,500 vs ₹5,500 for non-furnished. The difference covers the extra detailing time on furniture — sofa vacuum, dining chair legs, wardrobe interior detailing on extra units. We confirm the exact price on the call after you describe what's in the home.`}]},4:{intro:`4 BHK villa deep cleaning in Gurgaon from ₹6,500 — 4 bedrooms, 3–4 bathrooms, terrace, larger living areas. Marble-safe products, full day, 5 cleaners.`,detail:`The 4 BHK villa is a different product entirely from an apartment. 1,501–2,100 sq ft across [DLF Phase 5](/blog/dlf-phase-5-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html), Ardee City, Nirvana Country, Vatika City, and the newer sectors off [Sohna Road](/blog/sohna-road-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html). The home usually has Italian or Indian marble flooring, 4 bedrooms, 3–4 bathrooms (one with a [bathtub](/bathroom-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html)), a larger living + dining area, a terrace or large balcony, and sometimes a private garden or sit-out. Marble and wooden floors cannot be cleaned with the same acids and degreasers used in apartments — one wrong product and you etch the polish. That is why our 4 BHK team is briefed separately: marble-safe products, soft-pad machines for floors, no abrasive scrubbing on wooden panels.

A 4 BHK villa deep clean takes a full day (8–10 hours) with 5 cleaners. All 3–4 bathrooms get descaling, including the bathtub, jacuzzi jets, and shower glass partitions. The terrace gets a full scrub — algae, bird-droppings, drainage channels, railing wipe. The marble or wooden floors are cleaned with the right pH-neutral product. Kitchen gets the full chimney + hob + cabinet + tile treatment; villa kitchens are usually larger and have built-in appliances that need separate handling. Wardrobe interiors across 4 bedrooms. [Sofa and dining chairs](/sofa-shampoo-cleaning-gurgaon.html) get a deep vacuum and spot treatment. [Non-furnished villa is ₹6,500](/blog/deep-cleaning-cost-gurgaon-2026.html); furnished with sofa, dining, terrace furniture is ₹7,500–₹8,500. The villa layout (which floor is the master, parking access for our van, water source for machines) is confirmed on the call.

Most 4 BHK owners book us quarterly as part of regular villa upkeep, plus once before Diwali and once before/after a long trip. The marble-safe brief is what gets you repeat customers in this segment — one bad acid clean and the floor is ruined for years.`,faqsExtra:[{q:`Will the marble floor in my 4 BHK villa be damaged?`,a:`No — we use pH-neutral, marble-safe products on Italian and Indian marble. Our standard descaler (used for bathroom tiles) is acidic and we never use it on marble. Floor machines run soft pads, not abrasive brushes. If you have a specific marble brand or finish (polished, honed, leathered), mention it on the call and the team will adjust the product choice.`},{q:`Do you clean the terrace in a 4 BHK villa?`,a:`Yes — terrace cleaning is included in the 4 BHK package. We scrub floor tiles, clean drainage channels, wipe railings, and remove algae and bird droppings. For larger terraces with planters or outdoor furniture, mention it on the call so the team allocates the right time. Some terraces need a separate pressure wash (add-on) if the buildup is heavy.`}]},5:{intro:`5 BHK luxury villa deep cleaning in Gurgaon from ₹9,000 — 5 bedrooms, 4+ bathrooms, terrace, premium finishes. Finish-specific products, full day+, 6 cleaners.`,detail:`The 5 BHK is the premium tier — 2,500–3,000 sq ft in DLF Magnolias, Emaar Emerald Hills, [DLF Phase 5](/blog/dlf-phase-5-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html), the new Camellias projects, and select Manesar farmhouses. These homes have premium finishes throughout: Italian marble with specific sealants, wooden flooring (sometimes herringbone parquet), built-in wardrobes with veneer finishes, designer light fixtures, multiple AC indoor units, often a home theatre or bar area, sometimes a private elevator, and a 4+ bathroom layout with [rain showers](/bathroom-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html) and body jets. Standard apartment cleaning products and methods will damage these finishes. The 5 BHK team uses finish-specific products and tools, and runs a 2-pass system: first pass heavy detailing, second pass premium polish and inspection.

A 5 BHK deep clean takes 10–14 hours (we typically split across a full day, sometimes into a 2-day option) with 6 cleaners. All 4+ bathrooms get full descaling including rain shower heads, glass partitions, and any stone surrounds. The master bathroom usually has a jacuzzi or soaking tub that needs separate treatment. Wooden floors are cleaned with the manufacturer's recommended product class (we ask on the call). The kitchen is the most time-intensive room at this size — full [chimney dismantle](/kitchen-deep-cleaning-gurgaon.html), double ovens, wine fridge exterior, walk-in pantry if present. Wardrobe interiors across 5 bedrooms. The home theatre, bar area, and study get detailed dust + leather/cloth-appropriate treatment. Terraces (often 2 at this size) are scrubbed separately. Furnished 5 BHK with imported furniture, art, or specific care instructions is quoted on-site; standard furnished 5 BHK is ₹11,000–₹13,000. [Non-furnished is ₹9,000](/blog/deep-cleaning-cost-gurgaon-2026.html). The home layout, finishes, and any specific care instructions are confirmed on the call and on arrival.

Most 5 BHK owners book us quarterly, with extra pre-Diwali and pre-event visits. The premium-finish brief is non-negotiable at this tier — once a marble is etched or a wood floor is water-stained, restoration costs more than a year of our deep cleans.`,faqsExtra:[{q:`My 5 BHK has Italian marble and wooden floors. What products do you use?`,a:`We use pH-neutral, finish-specific products: marble-safe neutral cleaners for Italian and Indian marble, manufacturer-class cleaners for wooden and parquet floors (water-based, no wax buildup), and stone-safe descalers for bathroom surrounds. We do not use standard acids, bleach, or ammonia on any premium finish. If you have the marble/wood brand name or care guide, share it on the call and the team will match the product.`},{q:`How long does a 5 BHK deep clean take?`,a:`A standard 5 BHK takes 10–14 hours with a 6-person team — usually a full working day, sometimes split into 2 shorter days if the home is fully furnished and you prefer the team out by evening. 2-day deep cleans for very large or fully furnished 5 BHKs are quoted separately after a walkthrough.`}]}},s=e[t]||e[2];r.intro=s.intro,r.detail=s.detail,r.image=t===1?`/images/full-home-deep-cleaning.webp`:t===2?`/images/full-home-2bhk-deep-cleaning.webp`:t===3?`/images/full-home-3bhk-deep-cleaning.webp`:t===4?`/images/full-home-4bhk-deep-cleaning.webp`:`/images/full-home-5bhk-deep-cleaning.webp`,r.imageAlt=`${t} BHK full home deep cleaning in Gurgaon — ${((a=r.sqftByBhk)==null?void 0:a[t])||``} expert team`,r.faqs=[...r.faqs.filter(e=>!e.q.startsWith(`Full home cleaning me payment`)),...s.faqsExtra,{q:`Gurgaon me ${t} BHK full home deep cleaning ka rate kya hai?`,a:`${t} BHK full home deep cleaning Gurgaon me ${((o=n.priceByBhk)==null?void 0:o[t])||`₹4,500`} se shuru hoti hai, furnished ghar ke liye thoda zyada. Price call par lock ho jati hai.`},{q:`${t} BHK ki deep cleaning me kitna time lagta hai?`,a:`${t} BHK deep cleaning me ${t===1?`5–6`:t===2?`7–8`:t===3?`9–10`:`10–14`} ghante lagte hain ${t+1} cleaners ke saath.`}];let c={1:[[`AK`,`Amit Kumar`,`Sector 46, 1 BHK`,`Compact 1 BHK done perfectly in 5 hours — kitchen and bathroom look new. Great for Sohna Road apartments.`],[`NS`,`Neha Singh`,`DLF Phase 1, 1 BHK`,`1 BHK non-furnished was spotless, price locked at ₹2,500 as promised.`],[`SR`,`Sunil Rao`,`Palam Vihar, 1 BHK`,`Same-day 1 BHK clean, team shifted my single bed and cleaned behind it. Worth it.`]],2:[[`RG`,`Rohit Gupta`,`Sohna Road, 2 BHK`,`Best value for 2 BHK — 2 baths + balcony done in one visit, 7 hours with 4 cleaners.`],[`PM`,`Priya Mehta`,`DLF Phase 3, 2 BHK`,`2 BHK furnished with 2 baths — every wardrobe detailed, price ₹4,500 fixed.`],[`AD`,`Anjali Desai`,`Sector 57, 2 BHK`,`2 BHK deep clean removed hard-water scale from both bathrooms — impressive.`]],3:[[`VS`,`Vikram Sharma`,`MG Road, 3 BHK`,`3 BHK took 9 hours with 5 cleaners — sofa vacuum included as promised, house smells fresh.`],[`SP`,`Sunita Patel`,`South City, 3 BHK`,`Most thorough 3 BHK clean we’ve had — 3 baths descaled, kitchen degreased, pay after walkthrough.`],[`MK`,`Meera Kapoor`,`Golf Course Road, 3 BHK`,`3 BHK full-home + balcony, team brought all machines, finished before dinner.`]],4:[[`AK4`,`Arjun Kapoor`,`DLF Phase 5, 4 BHK Villa`,`4 BHK villa full day — 4 baths descaled, terrace cleaned, team professional.`],[`NS4`,`Nisha Sharma`,`Nirvana Country, 4 BHK`,`Large 4 BHK with 3 baths — full team, no hidden charges, ₹6,500 fixed.`],[`RG4`,`Rohan Gupta`,`Ardee City, 4 BHK`,`4 BHK deep clean handled marble floors carefully, no damage, pay after.`]],5:[[`AS5`,`Aman Singh`,`Emaar Emerald Hills, 5 BHK`,`5 BHK luxury villa — premium detailing, 6 cleaners, worth ₹9,000.`],[`PK5`,`Pooja Khanna`,`DLF Magnolias, 5 BHK`,`5 BHK penthouse full day+, every wardrobe and balcony spotless, owner present.`],[`VS5`,`Vikram Seth`,`Manesar, 5 BHK Villa`,`5 BHK 3000 sq ft villa — team came with extra machines, flawless.`]]};c[t]&&(r.reviews=c[t])}return r}export{w as t};